<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Biblica® Open Dangme Living New Testament &amp; Psalms</book>
  <para style="rem">Copyright © 1997 by Biblica, Inc.</para>
  <para style="h">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohane Manye Munyu Ɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane Manye Munyu ɔ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">La ngɛ diblii mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Loko a bɔ je ɔ, Kristo ngɛ, nɛ e kɛ Mawu ngɛ. Lɛ ji Mawu ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />E ngɛ kɛ je sisije, nɛ e ngɛ daa. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Lɛ nɛ e bɔ nɔ́ tsuaa no nɛ ngɛ; nɔ́ ko nɔ ko be je nɛ ɔ mi nɛ pi lɛ nɛ e bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Lɛ nɛ e hɛɛ neneene wami, nɛ jamɛ a wami ɔ nɛ haa nimli tsuo wami. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />E wami ɔ ji La nɛ ngɛ tsoe ngɛ diblii ɔ mi, se diblii ɔ li La nɛ e ji, nɛ e nyɛ we e nɔ hu nɛ e ye.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Mawu tsɔ Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ kɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />E ba nɛ e ba ye Kristo he odase nɛ e tsɔɔ nɔ nɛ e ji, konɛ a he e nɔ nɛ a ye. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Pi Yohane nitsɛ ji La a, se mohu La a he odase yemi he nɛ e ba ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Pee se ɔ, nɔ nɛ ji anɔkuale La a nitsɛ ba nɛ e ba kpɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ je ɔ mi.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Lɛ nɛ e bɔ je ɔ, se benɛ e ba a, je ɔ li e mi tso. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />E ba lɛ nitsɛ e nihi a ngɔ se a nya we e he. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Nihi bɔɔ nɛ nya e he, nɛ a he e nɔ ye ɔ, e pee mɛ Mawu bimɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Nɛ a fɔ nihi nɛ he e nɔ ye ɔ ekohu, pi ngɛ he lo nya, se mohu ngɛ Mawu suɔmi nya.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Kristo plɛ Nɔmlɔ adesa nɛ e ba hi wa kpɛti ngɛ zugba a nɔ, nɛ e hyi tɔ kɛ dloomi kɛ anɔkuale. Wa ti ni komɛ na e hɛ mi nyami ɔ kaa Hiɔwe Tsɛ ɔ Bi kake too ɔ hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane ngɔ Yesu kɛ tsɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohane tsɔɔ lɛ nine nɛ e de asafo nɛ bua e he nya a ke, “Nɔ nɛ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ i tu e he munyu ke, ‘Nɔ ko ma nɛ e pe mi kulaa. E ngɛ momoomo loko a fɔ mi.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ngɛ e dloomi fuu ɔ nya a, e jɔɔ wɔ tsuo babauu. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Mawu kɛ mlaa gu Mose nɔ kɛ ba, se Yesu Kristo ji nɔ nɛ ngɔ dloomi kɛ anɔkuale kɛ ba ha wɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Nɔ ko nɛ Mawu hyɛ, se e Bi kake too ɔ nɛ e kɛ lɛ ngɛ ɔ pɛ nɛ le lɛ, nɛ lɛ e ba tsɔɔ wɔ bɔ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ ngɛ ha.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Benɛ Yohane ngɛ Yesu he odase nɛ ɔ yee ɔ, Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ tsɔ osɔfo nguahi kɛ a se yeli kɛ je Yerusalem kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ a ba bi lɛ ke lɛ ji Mesia, Yiwamihelɔ nɛ ma a lo?<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohane de mɛ paa ke, “Pi imi ji Kristo ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Tsɔli ɔmɛ bi lɛ ekohu ke, “Lɛɛ mɛnɔ ji mo mɔ? Elia ji mo lo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Nɛ e ha mɛ heto ke, “Tsa pi imi i.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Jehanɛ ɔ a bi le ke, “anɛ mo ji Gbalɔ ɔ lo?” Nɛ e he nɔ ke, “Dabi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Tsɔli ɔmɛ ya nɔ nɛ a bi Yohane ke, “Lɛɛ mɛnɔ kulaa ji mo mɔ? Mo ha wɔ heto konɛ wa ya bɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ tsɔ wɔ ɔ amaniɛ. Kɛ o ngɛ dee kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Nɛ e he nɔ ke, “Ami ji gbi nɛ ngɛ pɛe ngɛ nga gbajaa a nɔ ngɛ dee kaa bɔ nɛ Gbalɔ Yesaia gba nɛ e de ke, ‘Nyɛ dla nyɛ he kɛ hyɛ Nutsɔ ɔ blɔ ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ pa tsɔ kɛ ho Yohane ngɔ ya. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Nɛ a ya bi lɛ ke, “Ke pi mo ji Yiwamihelɔ loo Elia loo Gbalɔ ɔ, lɛɛ mɛni he wami o ngɛ nɛ o baptisiɔ nɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohane ha mɛ heto ke, “Ami lɛɛ nyu pɛ nɛ i kɛ ngɛ baptisie, se nɔ ko ngɛ juami ɔ kpɛti ngɛ hiɛ ɔ amlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ kpi hyɛ; <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />nɛ e be kɛe nɛ e maa je e ni tsumi ɔ sisi ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti, nɔ nɛ i sɛ nɛ i peeɔ e sɔmɔlɔ po.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Sane nɛ ɔ ba ngɛ Betania, kɔpe ko nɛ ngɛ Yordan Pa a se he nɛ Yohane ngɛ nihi baptisie ngɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />E nɔ jena a, Yohane na Yesu nɛ ma e ngɔ, nɛ e de ke, “Hyɛ Mawu To Bi ɔ nɛ woɔ je ɔ tsuo he yayami kɛ yaa a. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />E he munyu nɛ i ngɛ tue ke, ‘E piɛ bɔɔ nɛ nɔ ko nɛ kle pe mi maa fie ye se kɛ ba, e ngɛ momo loko a bɔ mi ade.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Jinɛ i li kaa lɛ ji nɔ nɛ ma a, se imi lɛɛ i ngɛ baptisie kɛ nyu bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a je e mi tso ngɔ tsɔɔ ma a.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Nɛ Yohane kale bɔ nɛ e na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ kple si kɛ je hiɔwe kaa obleku lahuɛ kɛ ba ma Yesu yi kpɛti ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />E tsa nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ekohu ke, “I li kaa lɛ i, se benɛ Mawu tsɔ mi ke ma ya baptisi ɔ, e de mi ke, ‘Nɔ nɛ o maa na nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ma kple si kɛ ba ma e nɔ ɔ, lɛ ji nɔ nɛ blɔ nɛ o ngɛ hyɛe ɔ nɛ, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ maa baptisi kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />I na nɛ e ba mi ngɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ nɔ, nɛ i ye he odase kaa lɛ ji Mawu Bi ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsɛ kaseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />E nɔ jena benɛ Yohane kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti ni enyɔ daa si, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />nɛ Yesu ba be ɔ, Yohane hyɛ lɛ too nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ, Mawu To Bi ɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yohane kaseli enyɔ ɔmɛ plɛ a he, nɛ a nyɛɛ Yesu se.<verse eid="JHN 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Benɛ Yesu plɛ e he nɛ e na mɛ ngɛ e se ɔ, e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni nyɛ ngɛ hlae?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, jije o hii?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ba nɛ nyɛ ba hyɛ.” A nyɛɛ e se kɛ ho he nɛ e to ɔ ya nɛ a kɛ lɛ ya hi si kɛ je piani ngmlɛ eywiɛ kɛ ya si gbɔkuɛ nya si. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Kaseli enyɔ nɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ji Andrea, Simon Petro nyɛminyumu ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Nɛ Andrea ho ya de e nyɛmi Petro ke, “Wa na Yiwamihelɔ ɔ!” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Nɛ e kpaka Petro kɛ ba Yesu ngɔ. Yesu hyɛ Petro too nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mo ji Simon, Yohane binyumu ɔ nɛ, se a ma tsɛ mo ke Petro, e sisi ji Tɛsa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />E nɔ jena a, Yesu pee e juɛmi kaa e maa ya Galilea. E na Filipo nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ba nyɛɛ ye se.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipo je Betsaida, Andrea kɛ Petro mɛ a ma a mi.<verse eid="JHN 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipo hu ya na Natanael nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Wa na Yiwamihelɔ ɔ, nɔ nɛ Mose kɛ gbali ɔmɛ ngma e he sane ɔ. A tsɛɛ le ke, Yesu, Yosef nɛ je Nazaret ɔ bi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nɛ Natanael bi Filipo ke, “Nazaret! Anɛ nɔ́ kpakpa ko ma nyɛ je Nazaret lo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Nɛ Filipo de lɛ ke, “Moo lɛɛ moo ba nɛ mo nitsɛ o ba hyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Benɛ a maa ho Yesu ngɔ sumi ya a, Yesu de mɛ ke, “O nɛ, Israel no anɔkualetsɛ nɛ ma a nɛ, e sisi we nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nɛ Natanael bi Yesu ke, “Kɛ o pee kɛ le nɔmlɔ nɛ ji mi kɛɛ?” Nɛ e he nɔ ke, “I na mo ngɛ tso ko kaa mangoo tso ɔ sisi loko ji Filipo ba na mo ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Nɛ Natanael de Yesu ke, “Mawetsɛ, mo ji Mawu Bi, Israel Matsɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Akɛnɛ i de mo ke i na mo ngɛ tso ko kaa mangoo tso ɔ sisi he je nɛ o he ye ɔ lo? O maa na okadi nguahi nɛ kle pe enɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Nɛ o maa na nɛ hiɔwe tete nya bli nɛ Mawu bɔfo ɔmɛ ngɛ mi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yo kpeemi ngɛ Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ligbi enyɔ se ɔ, a ngɛ yo kpee ngɛ Kana ngɛ Galilea, nɛ Yesu nyɛ piɛ nihi nɛ a tsɛ mɛ ɔ a he. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />A tsɛ Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ hu kɛ ya yo kpeemi he ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Nɛ benɛ yo kpeemi wai ɔ ta a, Yesu nyɛ ba de lɛ ke, “A wai ɔ ta.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “Maa, i be nɔ́ ko nyɛɛ ma pee ha mo amlɔ nɛ ɔ, ye okadi peemi be ɔ sui lolo.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Se e nyɛ ɔ de e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e ma de nyɛ ke nyɛɛ pee ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Dudɔhi ekpa maa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a he fɔmi he, nɛ paya buɛhi nyingmi enyɔ loo nyingmi etɛ yaa kake mi.<verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu de sɔmɔli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ yɛ nyu kɛ wo dudɔ ɔmɛ a mi nɛ a hyi.” Benɛ a wo a mi nyu nɛ a hyi ɔ, e de mɛ ke, <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />“Nyɛɛ yɛ eko kɛ ya ha yo kpeemi nya dalɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Benɛ yo kpeemi nya dalɔ ɔ tso nyu nɛ plɛ wai nɛ e li he nɛ a kɛ je, se sɔmɔli ɔmɛ le ɔ, e tsɛ ayɛflo huno ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Wai nɛ ɔ ngɛ kpa kulaa! Nɔ́ nɛ a pɔɔ peemi ji a kɛ wai nɛ ngɔɔ ɔ ba maa si kekle, nɛ ke ni ɔmɛ de se loko a kɛ nɔ́ nɛ ngɔɛ ɔ ba maa si haa mɛ. Se moo lɛɛ o ngɔ wai kpakpa a mohu kɛ ba nyagbe.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Enɛ ɔ ji kekle nyakpɛ nɔ́ nɛ Yesu pee ngɛ ma hɛ mi ngɛ Kana ngɛ Galilea kɛ tsɔɔ hiɔwe he wami nɛ e hɛɛ ɔ, nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ he ye kaa lɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ niinɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu kɛ e nyɛ kɛ e nyɛmi ɔmɛ kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ tsuo pue nɔ kɛ ho Kapernaum ya, nɛ a ya ye ligbi bɔɔ pɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɔlemi We, pi jua nɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Benɛ e su Yuda bi ɔmɛ a Hebemi yemi ɔ, Yesu kpale kɛ ba Yerusalem.<verse eid="JHN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Nɛ e ba na jua yeli nɛ ngɛ nahi kɛ tohi kɛ obleku lahuɛhi juae kɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ sika tsakee ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e ngɔ kpa kɛ fie jua yeli ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ to ɔmɛ kɛ na amɛ kɛ je Sɔlemi We ɔ, nɛ e gbɛ sika tsakeli ɔmɛ a sika a ngɔ fia, nɛ e tsitsɛɛ okplɔɔ ɔmɛ ngɔ fɔ si. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Nɛ e de obleku lahuɛ juali ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ngɔ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ je hiɛ ɔ, nyɛ ko ngɔ ye Tsɛ We ɔ kɛ pee jua nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ kai nɔ́ nɛ a ngma ngɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a mi ke, “Mawu We ɔ he hɛ dɔ ma kpata ye hɛ mi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ bi Yesu ke, “Mɛni he blɔ nɛ o ngɛ nɛ o fieɔ jua yeli nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ jee Mawu We ɔ? Ke Mawu nɛ ha mo kikɛmɛ a he blɔ ɔ, lɛɛ moo pee nyakpɛ nɔ́ ko kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ nɛ waa hyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu he nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Saminya, nyakpɛ nɔ́ nɛ ma pee ha nyɛ ji, nyɛɛ ku Sɔlemi Tsu nɛ ɔ, nɛ ma ma lɛ ekohu ngɛ ligbi etɛ mi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Nɛ a de ke, “Mɛni o ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ? Jeha nyingmi eywiɛ kɛ ekpa nɛ a kɛ ma Sɔlemi Tsu nɛ ɔ, nɛ moo lɛɛ o kɛ ligbi etɛ pɛ maa ma lɛ lo?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Se e Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ ji Sɔlemi Tsu nɛ e ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Nɛ pee se benɛ e te si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ kai kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ, nɛ a na kaa nɔ́ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ngɛ e he ɔ ba mi.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Nɛ nihi fuu nɛ na nyakpɛ níhi nɛ e pee ngɛ Yerusalem benɛ a ngɛ Hebemi jeha a yee ɔ, he ye kaa lɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24-25" />Se Yesu lɛɛ e kɛ e he fɔɛ a nɔ, ejakaa e le Nɔmlɔ adesa su. Nɛ e hia we kaa nɔ ko nɛ de lɛ bɔ nɛ adesa subai tsakee ha.<verse eid="JHN 2:24-25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kɛ Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Ligbi ko nyɔ mi ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nɔkɔtɔma ko nɛ je Farisi bi ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ Nikodemo ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />ba Yesu ngɔ nɛ e ba de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, wɔ tsuo wa lɛ kaa Mawu tsɔ mo nɛ o ba tsɔɔ wɔ ni, nɛ nyakpɛ níhi nɛ o ngɛ pee ɔ yeɔ enɛ ɔ he odase paa.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Nɛ Yesu ha lɛ heto ke, “I ngɛ mo dee anɔkuale mi ke, Ke a fɔ we mo ekohu ɔ, o be Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi nyɛe maa sɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo bi lɛ ke, “A fɔ mi ekohu? Mɛni o ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ? Kɛ Nɔmlɔ nɛ bwɔ ɔ maa pee kɛ sɛ e nyɛ muklii mi nɛ a fɔ lɛ ekohu kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu he nɔ ke, “Nɔ nɛ i ngɛ mo dee ngɛ anɔkuale mi ji, ke a fɔ we nɔ ko kɛ ji nyu kɛ Mumi mi ɔ, e be Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi nyɛe maa sɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Nimli ma nyɛ fɔ ngɛ he lo mi, se Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ haa wami he nɛ je hiɔwe ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e ko pee mo nyakpɛ kaa i de mo ke ja a fɔ mo ekohu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Kaa bɔ nɛ o nuɔ kɔɔhiɔ fiami he, se o li he nɛ e je kɛ he nɛ e yaa a, ja a nɔuu nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ. Wa li nɔ nɛ e maa ngɔ kikɛmɛ a wami nɛ je hiɔwe nɛ ɔ kɛ ha.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo bi Yesu ke, “Kɛ o ngɛ tsɔɔe kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10-11" />Yesu he nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Yuda bi ɔmɛ a Tsɔɔlɔ nɛ a buu ji mo, mɛni he je nɛ o nui ni nɛ ɔmɛ a sisi ɔ? I ngɛ mo nɔ́ nɛ i le kɛ nɔ́ nɛ i na dee nɛ o he we mi yi. <verse eid="JHN 3:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ke i de mo zugba nɔ níhi nɛ ba ngɛ nimli a kpɛti nɛ o he we yi ɔ, kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ ke i de mo níhi nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ngɛ hiɔwe nɛ o ma he ye? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Ejakaa imi Yiwamihelɔ ɔ pɛ ji nɔ nɛ ba zugba a nɔ nɛ maa kpale kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ekohu.<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Mose wo ayawa sinɔ ɔ nɔ ngɛ tso nya ngɛ nga a nɔ ɔ, ja a nɔuu nɛ a ma wo ye nɔ ngɛ tso nɔ, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />konɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ ye nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e na neneene wami. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ejakaa Mawu suɔ je ɔ saminya nɛ e tsɔ e Bi kake too ɔ ngɔ mane konɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e hɛ mi nɛ ko kpata, se mohu e na neneene wami. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Mawu tsɔɛ e Bi ɔ kɛ bɛ je ɔ mi nɛ e ba puɛ je ɔ, se mohu nɛ e ba he je ɔ yi wami.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Nɛ nihi nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ, a be neneene fɔ bumi ko, se nihi nɛ ngɔɛ a hɛ kɛ fɔɛ e nɔ ɔ, a kojo mɛ nɛ a bu mɛ fɔ momo, ejakaa a he we Mawu Bi kake too ɔ nɔ yi. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Fɔ nɛ a bu mɛ ɔ sisi ji, La je hiɔwe kɛ ba je ɔ mi, se a suɔ diblii ɔ pe La a, ejakaa a ni tsumi ɔmɛ ɔ yayami i. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />A sume hiɔwe La a, ejakaa a suɔ nɛ a pee yayami ngɛ diblii mi. A je a he kɛ je La a he, ejakaa a ngɛ gbeye yee kaa La a ma je a sisi kpo nɛ a maa gbla a tue. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Se nihi nɛ peeɔ kpakpa a, a baa La a he kɛ bua jɔmi konɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ na kaa a ngɛ Mawu suɔmi nya ni tsue.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Pee se ɔ, Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ si Yerusalem kɛ ya hi Yudea bɔɔ nɛ a baptisi nihi ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kɛ Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23-24" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, a wui Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ tsu lolo, nɛ e ngɛ nihi baptisie ngɛ Ainon, ma ko nɛ ngɛ Salim ma a kasa mi ɔ, ejakaa nyu fuu ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Ligbi ko ɔ, Yohane kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ nɔ ko ngɛ nya sae, nɛ nɔ ɔ de mɛ ke Yesu baptisimi ɔ hi pe kulaa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, a ba Yohane ngɔ nɛ a ba de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, maminyumu ɔ nɛ kɛ mo kpe ngɛ Yordan Pa a se, nɛ o de wɔ ke lɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ hu ngɛ nihi baptisie, nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ e ngɔ yae ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ a si wɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohane ha mɛ heto ke, “Mawu nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ nɛ haa nɔ tsuaa nɔ e ni tsumi. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Ye ni tsumi ji kaa ma dla blɔ ɔ ngɔ to jamɛ a nɔ ɔ konɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ya e ngɔ. Nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ le kaa i de nyɛ ke tsa pi imi ji Mesia a; blɔ dlami he nɛ i sɛ hlami kɛ ba ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ fɛu ɔ nɛ tsɛɔ nihi; ayɛflo ɔ, e yaa he tsuaa he nɛ e huno ɔ ngɛ, nɛ e huno ɔ huɛmɛ kɛ lɛ nyaa. Yo he ɔ huno ɔ huɛ ji mi, nɛ ye bua jɔ ye he kaa e ye kunimi. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />E sa nɛ e ya nɔ nɛ imi lɛɛ ma ba si.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />E je hiɔwe nɛ e kle pe nɔ tsuaa nɔ. Imi lɛɛ a fɔ mi ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ, nɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ ni nɛ i le. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Nɔ́ nɛ e na kɛ nɔ́ nɛ e nu ɔ he odase e yeɔ, se nihi bɔɔ pɛ nɛ heɔ lɛ yeɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ heɔ lɛ yeɔ ɔ, naa kaa anɔkualetsɛ ji Mawu. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ejakaa nɔ nɛ Mawu tsɔ ɔ, Mawu Munyu e tuɔ, ejakaa Mawu Mumi ɔ hyi lɛ tɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tsɛ ɔ suɔ Bi ɔ, nɛ e to nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɔ wo e dɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Nihi tsuo nɛ heɔ Bi ɔ nɔ yeɔ ɔ naa neneene wami, se nihi nɛ he we lɛ yi kɛ nihi nɛ bui lɛ tue ɔ be neneene wami ɔ nae, se mohu Mawu mi mi fumi nɛ maa hi a nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kɛ Samaria yo ɔ ngɛ vu ɔ nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1-2" />Benɛ Yesu na lɛ kaa Farisi bi ɔmɛ nu kaa nihi babauu ngɛ e ngɔ bae pe bɔ nɛ a ngɛ Yohane ngɔ yae, nɛ e ngɛ mɛ baptisie nɛ e ngɛ kaseli fuu nae, be mi nɛ Yesu nitsɛ baptisii we se mohu e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ a ngɛ ni ɔmɛ baptisie ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 4:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />e si Yudea nɛ e kpale kɛ ba Galilea ekohu.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Nɛ e ya gu Samaria loko e ba Galilea. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Maa pee piani ngmlɛ nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ mi ɔ, e ba su Sikar kɔpe ɔ nɛ ngɛ Samaria kasa nya a he. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Lejɛ ɔ nɛ Yakob vu ɔ ngɛ, ngɛ zugba kpɔ ko nɛ Yakob ngɔ ha e bi Yosef ɔ nɔ.Yesu ho hi si ngɛ vu ɔ kasa nya nɛ e jɔɔ e he, ejakaa pɔ tɔ e he kɛ nyɛɛmi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />E yi be ko nɛ Samaria yo ko ba nyu sami. Yesu bi yo ɔ nɛ e ba lɛ nyu nɛ e nu. <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Yesu nɔ kake nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ejakaa e kaseli ɔmɛ ho ma a mi ya nɛ a ya he niye ni. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Samaria yo ɔ nya kpɛ e he nɛ e bi Yesu nɔ́ he je nɛ lɛ Yuda no ɔ e ngɛ lɛ Samaria no nɛ a bui ɔ nyu bie nɛ e nu. Ejakaa Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ Samaria bi ɔmɛ yi, nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ pɔɛ munyu tete tumi ha mɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu de yo ɔ ke, “Kaa o le Mawu nike nɔ nɛ e ngɛ kɛ ha mo, kɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ mo nyu ɔ bie nɛ ɔ, jinɛ mo mohu o ma bi lɛ nɛ e ha mo neneene wami nyu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Nɛ yo ɔ de lɛ ke, “Vu nɛ ɔ mi kuɔ, nɛ o be nyu sami kpa kɛ goga. Jije o ma na wami nyu nɛ ɔ kɛ je? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Anɛ o pe Yakob, wa nɛ ɔ lo? Kɛ o maa pee kɛ ha nyu nɛ hi pe vu nɛ ɔ mi nyu nɛ Yakob kɛ e bimɛ kɛ e lohwehi nuu ɔ kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu ha lɛ heto ke, “Nihi nɛ nuu nyu nɛ ɔ, kuma yee mɛ ekohu. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Se nyu nɛ i haa mɛ ɔ plɛɔ nyu hɛ ngmɛ nɛ baa ngɛ a mi daa kɛ daa nɛ e haa mɛ neneene wami.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Kɛkɛ nɛ yo ɔ de Yesu ke, “Mawetsɛ, i kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o ha mi jamɛ a nyu ɔ eko konɛ kuma nɛ ko ye mi hu, nɛ ma jɔɔ blɔ gaga nɛ ɔ nyɛɛmi kɛ vu nɛ ɔ nya bami daa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Yaa tsɛ o huno kɛ ba.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Yo ɔ he nɔ nɛ e de Yesu ke, “I be huno.” Yesu na kaa yo ɔ tu anɔkuale. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e de lɛ ke, “Munyu ngwɔhe nɛ o tu ɔ nɛ, <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />ejakaa o kɛ nyumuhi enuɔ hi si hyɛ, nɛ nyumu nɛ o kɛ lɛ ngɛ piɔ nɛ ɔ, tsa pi o huno i.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Yo ɔ de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, e maa pee gbalɔ ji mo. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Gerazim Yoku nɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ wa tsɛmɛ ja Mawu ngɛ. Mɛni he je nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ ke doo ja Yerusalem ji he nɛ sa kaa a ja Mawu ngɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “Mamiyo, mo he mi nɛ o ye kaa be ma, nɛ pi yoku nɛ ɔ nɔ loo Yerusalem nɛ nyɛ ma ja Tsɛ ɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Nyɛ jaa nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ li; wɔɔ lɛɛ wa jaa nɔ́ nɛ wa le, ejakaa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a ngɔ nɛ yi wami hemi ɔ je. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Se be ma, nɛ e su, nɛ anɔkuale jali ɔmɛ ma ja Tsɛ ɔ ngɛ mumi kɛ anɔkuale mi, ejakaa ja a ji bɔ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ ngɛ hlae nɛ a ja lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Mawu ɔ, mumi ji lɛ, nɛ nihi nɛ jaa lɛ ɔ, a ja lɛ ngɛ mumi kɛ anɔkuale mi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Yo ɔ de Yesu ke, “Saminya, i le kaa Mesia nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ Kristo ɔ maa ba, nɛ ke e ba a, e ma ba gba nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu he nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ami ji Mesia a nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Yesu nya nɔɛ si nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ba su vu ɔ nya. E pee mɛ nyakpɛ kaa e kɛ yo ɔ ngɛ ni sɛɛe, se a ti nɔ ko bi we lɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba loo nɔ́ nɛ e kɛ yo ɔ ngɛ sɛɛe ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28-29" />Kɛkɛ nɛ yo ɔ si e paya buɛ ɔ ngɛ vu ɔ nya nɛ e kpale kɛ ho ma a mi ya nɛ e ya de ni ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ba nɛ nyɛ ba hyɛ nyumu ko nɛ de mi nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ i pee hyɛ ɔ ha kaa tsa pi lɛ ji Kristo ɔ lo?” <verse eid="JHN 4:28-29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Nɛ ni ɔmɛ muɔ a he kɛ je ma a mi kɛ ba lɛ hyɛmi.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ lɛ pɛɛ kpae ke e wo e nya mi nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Se e de mɛ ke, “Dabi, i ngɛ niye ni nɛ i yeɔ nɛ nyɛ li.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ bi a he ke, “Anɛ nɔ ko ba haa lɛ niye ni ko lo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu gba mi kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ nɛ e de ke, “Ye niye ni ji kaa ma pee Mawu nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ suɔmi nya ni nɛ ma gbe e ni tsumi ɔ nya. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Anɛ nyɛ li kaa e piɛ hlami eywiɛ pɛ nɛ ni kpami be ɔ maa su lo? Nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he kɛ kpe, bɔ nɛ níhi bɔni fumi ngɛ ngmɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ ha kpami. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />A maa wo ni kpali ɔmɛ hiɔ bɔ nɛ sa, nɛ a ma bua neneene susuma amɛ a nya kɛ to ngɛ hiɔwe ni tomi he ɔmɛ; nɛ ni dulɔ kɛ ni kpalɔ tsuo ma na bua jɔmi kake. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ejakaa enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ munyu nɛ a tu ke nɔ ko ma du, nɛ nɔ ko ma kpa a maa ba mi. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />I tsɔ nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ya kpa ni ngɛ he nɛ nyɛ du we nɔ́ ko ngɛ, ni komɛ tsu ni ɔ momo, nɛ nyɛ ma na a ni tsumi ɔ he se.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Samaria bi nɛ ba vu ɔ nya a a ti nihi fuu he ye kaa lɛ ji Mesia a, ngɛ yo ɔ odase nɛ e ye ngɛ e he ke, “E de mi nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ i pee hyɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ Samaria bi ɔmɛ ba na lɛ ngɛ vu ɔ nya a, a kpa lɛ pee nɛ e ba hi a ngɔ bɔɔ; nɛ e kɛ mɛ ya hi si ligbi enyɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Nɛ nihi fuu he lɛ ye ngɛ munyuhi nɛ je e nya mi ɔ he. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Nɛ a de yo ɔ ke, “Jehanɛ ɔ wa he ye, tsa pi ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ o de wɔ ɔ he je. Wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa nu e nya mi gbi nɛ wa he ye kaa lɛ ji Kristo, je ɔ Yiwamihelɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ligbi enyɔ se ɔ, Yesu si Samaria nɛ e pue nɔ kɛ ho Galilea ya; <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />ejakaa lɛ nitsɛ e ye odase ke, “Gbalɔ ko be nɛ he ngɛ bumi ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e ma mi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Se benɛ e ya su Galilea a, a he lɛ atuu, ejakaa mɛ hu a ya Hebemi jeha yemi ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ nɛ a na nyakpɛ níhi nɛ e pee ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsa ma mi nɔkɔtɔma ko bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu kpa Galilea ma amɛ a nɔ, nɛ e ba su Kana ma nɔ he nɛ e plɛ nyu kɛ pee wai ngɛ ɔ ekohu. Nɛ benɛ e ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, ma mi nɔkɔtɔma ko ngɛ Kapernaum nɛ e bi ngɛ gboe ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />nu e he kaa e je Yudea nɛ e ngɛ si kpae ngɛ Galilea. Nyumu nɛ ɔ hia blɔ kɛ ba Yesu ngɔ ngɛ Kana nɛ e ba kpa lɛ pɛɛ nɛ e ba Kapernaum nɛ e ba tsa e bi nɛ ngɛ gbenɔ muɔ nya a ha lɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Nɛ Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ nyɛ ti nɔ ko be mi hee ye kaa ja i pee nyakpɛ nɔ́ ko kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ lolo?” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Se nɔkɔtɔma a de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, i kpa mo pɛɛ, ba loko ye bi ɔ yi nɛ ta.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Moo ya, o bi ɔ yi na wami.” Nyumu ɔ he Yesu ye nɛ e pue we mi blɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Benɛ e yaa ɔ, e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ ekomɛ kɛ lɛ ba kpe nɛ a de lɛ ke e binyumu ɔ na he wami. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />E bi mɛ benɛ e bɔni he wami nami, nɛ a he nɔ ke, “Asla a tsɔ ngɛ e nɔ si kake too hiɛ piani maa pee ngmlɛ kake mi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Kɛkɛ nɛ tsɛ ɔ kai kaa jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke e bi ɔ he mi wa lɛ ɔ nɛ. Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ nyumu ɔ kɛ e we ɔ tsuo he ye kaa Yesu ji Mesia a nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Enɛ ɔ ji nyakpɛ níhi enyɔ nɛ Yesu pee ngɛ Galilea benɛ e je Yudea kɛ ba lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsa nyumu ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu kpale kɛ ba Yerusalem ekohu ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a gbijlɔ ko yemi he. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Taku ko ngɛ Yerusalem ma a mi ngɛ Tohi Agbo ɔ kasa nya nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Betesda, nɛ asahi enuɔ ngɛ he. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Nɛ hiɔtsɛmɛ fuu nɛ ji libɔɔhi, hɛ ngmɛ yuyuili kɛ nihi nɛ ku pue si ngɛ asa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ a hii nyu ɔ mi klɛmi blɔ hyɛe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ bɔfo ba klɛɔ nyu ɔ mi be komɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ se ɔ hiɔtsɛ nɛ maa sɛ taku ɔ mi kekle ɔ naa he wami.<verse eid="JHN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Nyumu ko nɛ ku pue si jeha nyingmi etɛ kɛ kpaanyɔ sɔuu ji nɛ ɔ piɛɛ hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ a he ngɛ taku ɔ nya. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Benɛ Yesu na lɛ nɛ e le kaa e ngɛ hiɔ nue kɛ ɔ, e bi ke, “Anɛ o suɔ kaa o na he wami lo?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Nɛ hiɔtsɛ ɔ he nɔ ke, “I be nɔ ko nɛ ke a ba klɛ nyu ɔ mi nɛ e ma wo mi kɛ ya fɔ taku ɔ mi; nɛ ke i ngɛ mɔde bɔe nɛ ma ya sɛ mi ɔ, nɔ kpa sɛɔ ye hlami ya nɔɔ taku ɔ mi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Moo te si nɛ o hluɛ o sa a nɛ o ho we mi ya!”<verse eid="JHN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Nyumu ɔ na he wami amlɔ ɔ nɔuu, nɛ e hluɛ e sa a nɛ e bɔni nyɛɛmi. Se Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ nɛ Yesu tsu kikɛmɛ a nyakpɛ ni nɛ ɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a bua jɔɛ a he nɛ a de nɔ nɛ a tsa a ke, “O be he blɔ nɛ o tsuɔ ni ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ, nɛ ja a he je ɔ, o be he blɔ kaa o tlooɔ o sa a.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Nɛ nyumu ɔ he nɔ ke, “Nɔ nɛ tsa mi ɔ nɛ de mi ke ma tloo ye sa a.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Mɛnɔ ji nɔ nɛ de mo ke o pee ja?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Se nyumu ɔ nɛ a tsa a li nɔ nɛ tsa lɛ ɔ, ejakaa nihi fuu ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ Yesu ya futu a kpɛti. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Pee se ɔ, Yesu na lɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, o he mi wa mo; mo ko pee yayami hu, ke pi ja a nɔ́ ko yaya nɛ pe kekle nɔ́ ɔ maa ba o nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nyumu ɔ ho ya de Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ ke Yesu ji nɔ nɛ tsa lɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ bɔni Yesu haomi kaa e tɔ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi mlaa a nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Ye Tsɛ tsuɔ ni tsumi kpakpa be fɛɛ be nɛ imi hu i ngɛ ni tsue.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ na e he abofu nɛ a bɔni e he blɔ hlami nɛ a gbe lɛ, ejakaa tsa pi Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ kɛkɛ nɛ e tɔ, se mohu e ngɛ Mawu tsɛe ke e Tsɛ, nɛ e kɛ e he ngɛ Mawu he toe.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu he nɔ ke, “Bi ɔ be nyɛe maa pee nɔ́ ko ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e he wami nya, se mohu e kaseɔ nɔ́ nɛ e tsɛ pee ɔ, nɛ lɛ hu e peeɔ ja a pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Ejakaa Tsɛ ɔ suɔ Bi ɔ, nɛ e tsɔɔ lɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e peeɔ, nɛ Bi ɔ maa pee nyakpɛ ni nguahi nɛ pe nyumu nɛ ɔ tsami ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ tleɔ ni gbogboehi si kɛ jee gbeje nɛ e haa mɛ neneene wami ɔ, ja a nɔuu nɛ Bi ɔ hu ma tle nihi nɛ e suɔ si kɛ je gbeje. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Tsɛ ɔ ngmɛɛ yayami he kojomi tsuo he kɛ ha Bi ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />konɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ bu Bi ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ a buu Tsɛ ɔ. Nɛ nɔ nɛ bui Mawu Bi ɔ, blɔ e bui Tsɛ ɔ hulɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ buɔ ye munyu ɔ tue nɛ e heɔ Mawu nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e ma na neneene wami, nɛ a be lɛ kojoe ngɛ e yayami ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa a je lɛ kɛ je gbenɔ mi kɛ ba wami mi momo. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ekohu ke be ma, nɛ e su ta, nɛ ni gbogboehi maa nu Mawu Bi ɔ gbi, nɛ nihi nɛ maa bu tue ɔ a yi ma na wami. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Tsɛ ɔ ngɛ wami ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e mi, nɛ e ha Bi ɔ hu he blɔ nɛ e hi wami ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e mi; <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />nɛ e ha lɛ he blɔ kaa e kojo nimli adesahi a he yayami, ejakaa Nɔmlɔ Bi ji lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Enɛ ɔ ko pee nyɛ nyakpɛ tsɔ, ejakaa be ma nɛ ni gbogboe ɔmɛ ngɛ yɔkɔ ɔmɛ a mi ɔ maa nu Mawu Bi ɔ gbi, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />nɛ a maa te si ekohu, nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ pee kpakpa a maa te si kɛ maa ya neneene wami mi, nɛ a maa kojo nihi nɛ ngɛ yayami pee kɛ sa a.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Se i kojo we nɔ ko nɛ Tsɛ ɔ li he nɔ́ ko. I yeɔ e gbi nɔ, nɛ i kojoɔ kaa bɔ nɛ e deɔ mi, nɛ ye kojomi ɔ mu ko be he, ejakaa tsa pi ye suɔmi nya, se mohu Mawu nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ suɔmi nya kojomi nɛ i kojoɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Ke ami nitsɛ i ye ye he odase ɔ, a he we yi. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Se nɔ kpa ko nɛ ji Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ hu nɛ ngɛ ye he odase yee. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Nyɛ bu e fiɛmi ɔ tue, nɛ i ngɛ nɔ mi mae ha nyɛ, kaa anɔkuale odase nɛ e ye ngɛ ye he ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />I kai nyɛ Yohane odase yemi ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ he mi ye nɛ a he nyɛ yi wami; se ye he anɔkuale odase ɔ, tsa pi nɔmlɔ adesa ngɔ nɛ e je. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohane ji la ko nɛ kpɛ kɛ ha nyɛ ngɛ be bɔɔ mi, nɛ nyɛ na e he se, nɛ nyɛ bua jɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Se ami lɛɛ i ngɛ odase nɛ pa Yohane nɔ́ ɔ, ejakaa nyakpɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ ha mi nɛ i ngɛ pee ɔ tsɔɔ kaa Tsɛ ɔ nɛ tsɔ mi. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />E ngɛ mi kaa nyɛ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ hyɛ, nɛ e kɛ nyɛ tu we munyu hu hyɛ, se lɛ nitsɛ ye ye he odase. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ bui lɛ tue, ejakaa nyɛ he we ami e tsɔlɔ ɔ yi.<verse eid="JHN 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Nyɛ hlaa Ngmami ɔmɛ a mi, ejakaa nyɛ he ye kaa a ma ha nyɛ neneene wami, nɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ nɔuu yeɔ ye he odase. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Se loloolo ɔ, nyɛ sume kaa nyɛ maa ba ye ngɔ nɛ ma ha nyɛ neneene wami nɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />E pee we mi nyakpɛ kaa nyɛ he we mi yi, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />ejakaa i le kaa Mawu suɔmi be nyɛ mi. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />I le kaa nyɛ sume Tsɛ ɔ, ejakaa i ba ngɛ e nane mi nɛ nyɛ he we mi kɛ hɛ muɔ, se nyɛ heɔ nihi nɛ ba ngɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a suɔmi nya a mohu atuu. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Nɛ e be nyakpɛ kaa nyɛ he we nɛ nyɛɛ ye, ejakaa nyɛ woɔ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ hɛ mi nyami nɛ nyɛ di hɛ mi nyami nɛ jee Mawu ngɔ ɔ se.<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Se tsa pi ami nɛ i ma po nyɛ nya kɛ ha Tsɛ ɔ, Mose mohu i, nɔ nɛ mlaahi a nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɔ nyɛ hɛ kɛ fɔ kaa nyɛ maa ya hiɔwe ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Se nyɛ sume nɛ nyɛ he Mose nyɛɛ ye. E ngma ye he sane, se nyɛ he we nyɛɛ ye, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ nyɛ he we ye nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Nɛ akɛnɛ nyɛ he we lɛ yi ɔ, e be nyakpɛ kaa nyɛ he we ami hu yi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha nihi akpe enuɔ niye ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu po Galilea Wo ɔ nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Tiberia a. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Nɛ nihi fuu nyɛɛ e se nɛ a ya hyɛ bɔ nɛ e tsaa hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ ha. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3-4" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a ti nihi ji nihi nɛ yaa Yerusalem nɛ a ya ye Hebemi Ligbi ɔ. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ Yesu kuɔ yoku ɔ nɛ e ya hi si nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ bɔle lɛ ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 6:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />e na nihi babauu nɛ a ngɛ yoku ɔ kuɔe kɛ ma e ngɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ e plɛ e he nɛ e bi Filipo ke, “Jije wa ma na abolo ngɛ kɛ ha nimli nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a maa ye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Se Yesu bi Filipo munyu nɛ ɔ kɛ ngɛ lɛ kae nɛ e hyɛ, ejakaa e le nɔ nɛ e maa pee momo.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo he nɔ ke, “Abolo sidi lafa enyɔ po be mɛ sue.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8-9" />Nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ ji Andrea, Simon Petro nyɛmi ɔ de Yesu ke, “Jokuɛ nyumuyo ko ngɛ hiɛ ɔ nɛ hɛɛ abolo enuɔ kɛ lo enyɔ. Anɛ e maa su ma asafo ɔ kulaa lo?”<verse eid="JHN 6:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Se Yesu de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha nɛ a ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e hi si.” Nɛ nyumuhi nɛ a yi bɔ maa su akpe enuɔ ɔ tsuo ho ya hi si ngɛ nga a nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu wo abolo kɛ lo ɔ, nɛ e sɔle kɛ na Mawu si, nɛ e kɛ ha ni ɔmɛ, nɛ a ye nɛ a tɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Benɛ a tɔ ɔ, Yesu de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛ bua bibliwi nɛ piɛ ɔ nya, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko da.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ bua bibliwi nɛ piɛ ɔ nya nɛ a na kusii nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Benɛ ni ɔmɛ na nyakpɛ ni ɔ nɛ Yesu tsu ɔ, a de ke, “Anɔkuale, nɔ nɛ ɔ ji Gbalɔ nɛ wa ngɛ blɔ hyɛe ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu na kaa a ngɛ hlae nɛ a nu lɛ nɛ a wo lɛ matsɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e je a he kɛ sɛ yoku ɔ mi.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Benɛ e su gbɔkuɛ nya si ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ pue nɔ kɛ ho wo ɔ nya ya ya ngɛ lɛ blɔ hyɛe. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Se benɛ du bu nɛ loloolo ɔ e bɛ ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ ya sɛ lɛ mi nɛ a bɔni wo ɔ pomi kɛ yaa Kapernaum. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Benɛ a yaa a, e yi be ko nɛ kɔɔhiɔ ngua ko ba te tlukaa nɛ wo ɔ gli nɛ nyu bɔni lɛ ɔ mi sɛmi. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Se benɛ a hlui le ɔ maa pee si tomi he etɛ loo eywiɛ ɔ, a na Yesu nɛ ngɛ wo ɔ nɔ nyɛɛe kɛ ma a ngɔ nɛ a tsui po. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɛ mɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke lɛ i, lɔ ɔ he ɔ a ko ye gbeye. <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Jehanɛ ɔ a ngɛ hlae kaa e ba sɛ le ɔ mi, se si kake too nɛ a ke a maa hyɛ ɔ, lɛ ɔ ya su he nɛ a yaa a.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />E nɔ jena mɔtu benɛ a kpale kɛ ba wo ɔ se ɔ, a ba na nihi fuu nɛ bua a he nya ngɛ wo ɔ nya kɛ ngɛ lɛ mlɛe. Ejakaa a le kaa e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ ba lɛɛ se a je e he ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Tiberia lɛ kpa komɛ ngɛ wo ɔ nya lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Lɔ ɔ he ɔ, benɛ a na kaa Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ be lejɛ ɔ, a sɛ lɛ ɔmɛ a mi kɛ bu a nɔ kɛ ba Kapernaum ba ngɛ lɛ hlae.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Nɛ benɛ a ba na lɛ ɔ, a bi lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, kɛ o pee kɛ ba su hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu he nɔ de mɛ ke, “Anɔkuale ji kaa nyɛ ngɛ mi hlae, ejakaa i ha nyɛ niye ni nɛ nyɛ ye, se tsa pi ye nɔ nɛ nyɛ heɔ yeɔ he je. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ níhi kaa niye ni nɛ puɛɔ ɔ, a se dimi nɛ pee nyɛ kɔmɔ tsɔ, se mohu nyɛɛ di neneene wami nɛ ami Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ i ma ha nyɛ ɔ se. Ejakaa enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Tsɛ Mawu ɔ tsɔ mi kɛ ba ngɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />A he nɔ nɛ a bi ke, “Mɛni wa maa pee nɛ maa sa Mawu hɛ mi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nɔ nɛ Mawu ngɛ hlae ji kaa nyɛ he e tsɔlɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />A he nɔ ke, “Ke o ngɛ hlae nɛ wa he ye kaa mo ji Mesia a, lɛɛ moo pee nyakpɛ níhi kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Moo ke wɔ abolo daa ligbi kaa bɔ nɛ wa tsɛ ɔmɛ na benɛ a hia blɔ ngɛ nga a nɔ ɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ke, ‘Mose ha mɛ abolo nɛ je hiɔwe ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “Tsa pi Mose nɛ ha mɛ abolo nɛ je hiɔwe ɔ, se ye Tsɛ ɔ nɛ ha mɛ. Nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e ha nyɛ anɔkuale Abolo nɛ je Hiɔwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kikɛmɛ a anɔkuale Abolo nɛ ɔ ji Nɔmlɔ Adesa nɛ Mawu tsɔ kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ ba a nɛ, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ haa je ɔ tsuo neneene wami ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Jehanɛ ɔ a de Yesu ke, “Mawetsɛ, mo ha wɔ kikɛmɛ a abolo nɛ ɔ daa ligbi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Nɛ Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Ami ji Wami Abolo ɔ nɛ. Nɔ ko be ye ngɔ bae nɛ hwɔ maa ye lɛ ligbi ko gblee; nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ heɔ ye nɔ yeɔ ɔ, kuma be mɛ yee kɔkɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Se kaa bɔ nɛ i de nyɛ momo ɔ, nyɛ na mi lɛɛ, se nyɛ he we ye nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Se ni komɛ maa ba ye ngɔ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ ha mi ɔ, nɛ ke a ba a, i be mɛ fiee kɔkɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Ejakaa tsa pi ami nitsɛ ye suɔmi nya ni peemi he nɛ i je hiɔwe kɛ ba ngɛ, se mohu Mawu, nɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ suɔmi nya ni he nɛ i ba ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Nɛ Mawu suɔmi nya ji kaa nihi nɛ e ngɔ ha mi ɔ a ti nɔ kake nɛ ko laa, se mohu ma tle mɛ si kɛ ba neneene wami mi ngɛ Nyagbe Ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ejakaa ye Tsɛ ɔ suɔmi nya ji kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ e Bi ɔ nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e na neneene wami, nɛ ma tle lɛ si ngɛ Nyagbe Ligbi ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ bɔni huhuɛmi ngɛ e he, ejakaa e de ke lɛ ji Abolo nɛ je hiɔwe ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Nɛ a de ke, “Kɛ e ngɛ tsɔɔe kɛɛ? Anɛ tsa pi Yosef bi Yesu ɔ nɛ wa le e tsɛ kɛ e nyɛ ɔ ji nɛ ɔ lo? Kɛ pee kɛɛ nɛ e deɔ ke e je hiɔwe kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Se Yesu he nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ko huhuɛ ngɛ nɔ nɛ i de ɔ he. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Ejakaa nɔ ko be ye ngɛ nyɛe maa ba, ja Tsɛ ɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ ha lɛ he blɔ, nɛ ma tle jamɛatsɛ ɔmɛ kulaa si kɛ ya neneene wami mi ngɛ Nyagbe Ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ a de nyɛ ngɛ Ngmami ɔ mi ɔ, ‘Mɛ tsuo kulaa a maa pee ye nihi nɛ a tsɔɔ mɛ Mawu he ni.’ Ni nɛmɛ nɛ nuɔ Tsɛ ɔ munyu ɔ nɛ a kaseɔ anɔkuale ɔ kɛ jee e ngɔ ɔ, a maa ba ye ngɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ we kaa nɔ ko na Tsɛ ɔ hyɛ, ja ami pɛ ji nɔ nɛ na lɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ ye nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e na neneene wami ɔ momo. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Niinɛ, ami ji Wami Abolo ɔ nɛ! <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Benɛ nyɛ tsɛ ɔmɛ ye abolo nɛ a ha mɛ ngɛ nga a nɔ ɔ, a gbo, ejakaa wami be mi. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Se abolo nɛ je hiɔwe ɔ haa nɔ nɛ yeɔ eko ɔ neneene wami. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Ami ji Wami Abolo nɛ je hiɔwe kɛ ba a nɛ. Nɔ nɛ maa ye kikɛmɛ a abolo nɛ ɔ be gboe, e maa hi si kɛ ya neneene, ejakaa abolo nɛ ɔ ji ye he lo nɛ a kɛ ha ngɛ je ɔ yi wami hemi he.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ bɔni nya sami ngɛ munyu nɛ e tu ɔ he ke, “Kɛ Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ maa pee nɛ e ha wɔ e he lo nɛ waa ye kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ekohu ke, “Anɔkuale munyu i ngɛ nyɛ tue ke, ke nyɛ yi Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ he lo, nɛ nyɛɛ nu e muɔ ɔ, nyɛ nine be neneene wami ɔ nɔ sue. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Se nɔ nɛ yeɔ ye he lo nɛ e nuɔ ye muɔ ɔ, jamɛ a nɔ ɔ ngɛ neneene wami, nɛ i ma tle lɛ si ngɛ Nyagbe Ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Ejakaa ye he lo ɔ ji niye ni nitsɛ, nɛ ye muɔ ɔ hu ji nyu nunui nitsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Nɔ nɛ yeɔ ye he lo nɛ e nuɔ ye muɔ ɔ, e ngɛ ye mi, nɛ ami hu i ngɛ e mi. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Wami Tsɛ ɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ he wami nya nɛ ye hɛ ngɛ ngɛ, nɛ ja a nɔuu nihi nɛ maa ye ye he lo nɛ a maa nu ye muɔ ɔ, a maa hi hɛ ngmengmle mi ngɛ ye he je. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ami ji anɔkuale Abolo nɛ je hiɔwe ɔ nɛ; nɔ nɛ maa ye ye Abolo nɛ ɔ ma na neneene wami nɛ e be gboe kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ tsɛ ɔmɛ ye abolo nɛ je hiɔwe nɛ a gbo ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu tu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ benɛ e ngɛ sɔlemi pee ngɛ Kapernaum kpe he ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ tete po de ke, “Munyu nɛ ɔmɛ a mi kuɔ. Mɛnɔ ma nyɛ a sisi maa tsɔɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Benɛ Yesu na kaa munyu ɔ ngɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ a juɛmi nya gbae ɔ, e de mɛ ke, “Anɛ enɛ ɔ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ haoe ɔ lo? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Lɛɛ ke nyɛ na ami Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ nɛ i ngɛ kpalee kɛ yaa hiɔwe ekohu ɔ nɛɛ, kɛ nyɛ ma susu kɛɛ? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ pɛ ji nɔ nɛ haa neneene wami; nɛ nihi nɛ a fɔ mɛ si kake kɛ gu he lo mi pɛ ɔ, a nine be dloomi nike ni nɛ ɔ nɔ sue. Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, i de nyɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ maa pee nɛ nyɛ nine maa su kikɛmɛ a anɔkuale mumi mi wami nɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Se nyɛ ti ni komɛ he we mi yi.” Yesu de mɛ enɛ ɔ, ejakaa e le kɛ je sisije ɔ nihi nɛ he we lɛ yi ɔ kɛ nɔ nɛ maa tsɔɔ e se blɔ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Nɛ e de ke, “Enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ tsɔɔe benɛ i de ke nɔ ko be ye ngɔ nyɛe maa ba kaa ja Tsɛ ɔ ha lɛ he blɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Benɛ Yesu de enɛ ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nihi fuu kpale ngɛ e se.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu po e he nɛ e bi e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ ke, “Anɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ ngɛ kpalee ngɛ ye se lo?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simon Petro he nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, mɛnɔ ngɔ wa yaa? Mo pɛ o nya nɛ neneene wami gbi ngɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />nɛ wa he ye, nɛ wa le hu kaa mo ji Mawu Bi nɛ he tsɔ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ni nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ nɛ i hla, se nyɛ kpɛti nɔ kake ɔ Abosiami i.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yuda Iskariot nɛ ji Simon bi ɔ he munyu nɛ Yesu ngɛ tue ɔ nɛ, ejakaa lɛ ji kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ nɛ maa tsɔɔ e se blɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu he munyu tumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu ho Galilea ya, nɛ e ya kpa kɔpekɔpe ɔmɛ a nɔ. E sume nɛ e hi Yudea, ejakaa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ lɛ hlae nɛ a gbe. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Se e kɛ we nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a daa jeha Bo Tsu mi sɔlemi kaimi be ɔ bɔni sumi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Nɛ Yesu nyɛmi ɔmɛ de lɛ ke, “Moo ya Yudea he nɛ a ngɛ jeha yee ngɛ ɔ, konɛ nihi fuu nɛ na nyakpɛ ni nɛ o ngɛ tsue ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />O biɛ be pɛe ke o ngɛ laami tso mi kikɛ nɛ ɔ. Ke o ngɛ he wami kaa kikɛ ɔ niinɛ ɔ, mo je lɛ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ je ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />A de enɛ ɔ, ejakaa e nyɛmi ɔmɛ tete he we lɛ yi.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “E sui be nɛ sa nɛ ma ya Yudea a lolo. Nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ maa ya be fɛɛ be nɛ nyɛ suɔ nɛ nɔ́ ko be bae. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Ejakaa nyɛɛ lɛɛ je ɔ be nyɛ nyɛe maa nyɛ, se ami lɛɛ e ngɛ mi nyɛe ngɛ e hɛ mi nɛ i kaa ngɛ e yayami ɔmɛ a he ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Nyɛɛ sɛ hlami nɛ i ma fie nyɛ se ke ye be ɔ su.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ja a he ɔ, e tlɔ si ngɛ Galilea.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Se benɛ e nyɛmi ɔmɛ je se ɔ, e bu a nɔ zaa nɛ e je we e he si nɛ ma a nɛ na lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ hla lɛ ngɛ jeha yemi ligbi ɔ nɔ, nɛ a bi e si kɛ po si kaa nɔ ko na lɛ lo. <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Ni ɔmɛ tu e he munyu babauu, nɛ a ti ni komɛ de ke, “Nyakpɛ nɔmlɔ ko ji lɛ,” nɛ ni komɛ hu de ke, “Ma a kuasia nɛ e ngɛ pee.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Se nɔ ko je we e hɛ mi nɛ e tu e he munyu kpakpa ko, ejakaa a ngɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ gbeye yee.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Se benɛ jeha yemi ɔ ya nɔ kɛ su he ko ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu pue nɔ kɛ ho Sɔlemi We ɔ ya nɛ e ya fiɛ paa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Enɛ ɔ pee Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ nyakpɛ nɛ a bi ke, “Kɛ Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ kase we ni ngɛ wa ni kasemi he ɔ pee kɛ le níhi a mi fitsofitso kikɛ ɔ kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Tsa pi ami nitsɛ ye juɛmi mi ni nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ tsɔɔe ɔ, se nɔ nɛ Mawu tsɔ mi ke ma ba de nyɛ ɔ i. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Ke nyɛ ti nɔ ko suɔ nɛ e pee Mawu suɔmi nya ni ɔ, e maa le ye fiɛmi ɔ mi tso kaa e je Mawu ngɔ aloo ami nitsɛ ye nɔ i. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Nɔ ko nɛ peeɔ lɛ nitsɛ e yi mi nɔ́ ɔ, lɛ nitsɛ e hɛ mi nyami nɛ e ngɛ hlae, se tsɔlɔ nɛ peeɔ nɔ nɛ tsɔ lɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami womi nihi ɔ, e ji anɔkualetsɛ kɛ nɔmlɔ kpakpa. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Nyɛ ti nɔ ko yi Mose mlaa amɛ a nɔ. Mɛni he je mɔ nɛ nyɛ te si kɛ wo mi ke i yi mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ? Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ mi hlae nɛ nyɛɛ gbe ngɛ enɛ ɔ he?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Asafo ɔ he nɔ ke, “O juɛmi be saminya. Mɛnɔ ngɛ mo hlae nɛ e gbe?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu he nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “I tsa hiɔtsɛ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ nɛ nyɛ nya kpɛ nyɛ he, ejakaa nyɛ ke i tsu ni. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Anɛ nyɛ wui nyɛ bimɛ nyumu mi ngɛ Mose mlaa a nya ke ligbi nɛ ɔ ya nɔ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ lo? Se kikɛmɛ a kusumi nɛ ɔ ngɛ loko ji Mose mlaa amɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Nɛ ke nyɛ yeɔ kusumi nɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ na ye he abofu kaa i tsa nɔmlɔ nɛ e na he wami kulaa ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ mɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Ke nyɛ susu munyu nɛ ɔ he saminya a, nyɛ maa na kaa ye nɔ́ da.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Yerusalem bi ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ bi a he ke, “Anɛ tsa pi nyumu nɛ ɔ nɛ a ngɛ hlae nɛ a gbe ɔ lo? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Nyɛ nɛ lɛ nɛ e ngɛ fiɛe paa ngɛ ma a nɔ se a de we lɛ nɔ ko. Aloo wa nikɔtɔma amɛ ba na le jehanɛ ɔ kaa lɛ ji Mesia a niinɛ lo? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Se kɛ e ba kɛɛ? Ejakaa wa le he nɛ a fɔ nyumu nɛ ɔ ngɛ; se ke Kristo maa ba a, tlukaa nɛ e ma ba je kpo nɛ nɔ ko be lee he nɛ e je.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ Yesu ngɛ fiɛe ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, e de ke, “E ngɛ mi kaa nyɛ le mi kɛ he nɛ a fɔ mi ngɛ kɛ he nɛ a lɛ mi ngɛ, se Nɔmlɔ nɔ nɛ nane mi nɛ i daa si ngɛ ɔ lɛɛ nyɛ li lɛ. Lɛ ji anɔkuale ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Ami lɛɛ i le lɛ ejakaa i kɛ lɛ nɛ ngɛ, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ tsɔ mi nyɛ ngɔ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ hla kaa a maa nu lɛ se nɔ ko nine tɛ e he, ejakaa Mawu be nɛ e to ɔ sui lolo.<verse eid="JHN 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Asafo ɔ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ a ti nihi fuu he lɛ ye nɛ a de ke, “Mɛni nyakpɛ ni po nɛ Kristo ɔ maa pee ke e ba a, nɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ pee we lo?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Se benɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ nu kaa asafo ɔ ngɛ Yesu he munyu kpakpa tue ɔ, a tsɔ tsɔli komɛ ke a ya nu lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Tsa pi piɔ. E piɛ be saii nɛ i kɛ nyɛ maa hi si lolo loko ji ma kpale kɛ ho nɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ ngɔ ya. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Nyɛ ma hla mi se nyɛ be mi nae. Nɛ he nɛ i yaa a hu nyɛ be lejɛ ɔ nyɛe maa ba.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ nui munyu nɛ ɔ sisi. Ja a he je ɔ a bi a he ke, “Jije e yaa nɛ wa be lɛ nae ɔ? Eko ɔ, e ngɛ hlae nɛ e si ma a mi nɛ e ya fiɛ ngɛ Yudea ma kpahi a nɔ, aloo nɛ e je kɛ ho Hela bi ɔmɛ loo ma je li ɔmɛ a ngɔ ya. <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Nɛ mɛni e ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa, ‘Nyɛ ma hla mi se nyɛ be mi nae, nɛ he nɛ i ngɛ ɔ hu nyɛ be lejɛ ɔ nyɛe bami’ ɔ?”,<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ngɛ jeha yemi ɔ se simi ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, Yesu de asafo ɔ kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Nɔ nɛ kuma ngɛ lɛ yee ɔ, e ba ye ngɔ nɛ e ba nu nyu. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Ejakaa Ngmami ɔ de ke nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ mi yeɔ ɔ wami pahi maa be ngɛ e mi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Se Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ a maa ngɔ kɛ ha nihi nɛ he ɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue ɔ nɛ; se Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ bɛ lolo, ejakaa Yesu na we nɛ e kpale kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ngɛ e anunyami ɔ mi lolo.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Benɛ asafo ɔ a ti ni komɛ nu nɔ nɛ e de ɔ, a de ke, “Nyumu nɛ ɔ ji gbalɔ ɔ nɛ maa nyɛɛ Mesia a hlami ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />A ti ni komɛ hu de ke, “Lɛ ji Mesia a nɛ.” Nɛ ni komɛ hu de ke, “Tsa pi lɛ i! Anɛ Mesia a, Galilea nɛ e maa je lo? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ejakaa Ngmami ɔ ma nɔ mi kaa Matsɛ David weku ɔ mi, ngɛ Betlehem kɔpe he nɛ a fɔ David ngɛ ɔ, lejɛ ɔ nɛ a ma fɔ Mesia a ngɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ mi gbami ba asafo ɔ mi ngɛ e he. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Nɛ a ti ni komɛ hla kaa a nu lɛ, se nɔ ko nine tɛ e he.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Nɛ tsɔli nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ tsɔ ɔ kpale kɛ ba a ngɔ dɛ gu, nɛ a bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ nui lɛ kɛ bɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Tsɔli ɔmɛ he nɔ nɛ a de mɛ ke, “Nyakpɛ munyuhi nɛ e ngɛ tue ɔ, wa nui eko hyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Farisi bi ɔmɛ ye a he fɛu nɛ a de ke, “Lɛɛ a mlɔɔ nyɛ hu lo? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Anɛ nyɛ na kaa Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ loo Farisi bi ɔmɛ a ti nɔ ko he ye kaa lɛ ji Mesia a lo? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Se asafo nɛ ɔ nɛ li mi eko ɔ nɛ he ye. Nɛ gbiɛmi ngɛ a nɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodemo nɛ ji Yuda nɔkɔtɔma ko nɛ ba Yesu ngɔ ligbi ko ngɛ laami mi ɔ bi mɛ ke, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Anɛ e da ngɛ mlaa nya kaa a buu nɔ ko fɔ be mi nɛ a kojo we lɛ lo?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />A he nɔ nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ mo hu Galilea no ji mo lo? Mo ya kane Ngmami ɔ saminya nɛ mo nitsɛ o maa na kaa gbalɔ ko be Galilea jee gblee!”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a gbɛ kpe ɔ nɛ a ti nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ho e we mi ya.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yo ajuama bɔlɔ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yesu kpale kɛ ho Nuyoku ɔ nɔ ya; <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />se e nɔ jena mɔtu mla a, e ba Sɔlemi We ɔ ekohu. E yi be ko nɛ nihi fuu ba bua a he nya ngɛ e ngɔ. Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e pɔɔ peemi ɔ, e ho hi si nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ ni. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Benɛ e ngɛ munyu tue ɔ, Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ kpaka yo ajuama bɔlɔ ko kɛ ba da si ngɛ asafo ɔ hɛ mi nɛ a bi lɛ ke, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />“Tsɔɔlɔ, wa nu yo nɛ ɔ paa nɛ e ngɛ ajuama bɔe. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mose mlaa a tsɔɔ kaa e sa gbenɔ. Kɛ moo lɛɛ o ngɛ dee kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />A bi Yesu munyu nɛ ɔ nɛ a kɛ ka lɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na nɔ́ ko nɔ nɛ a da kɛ po e nya. Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu ma e yi si nɛ e bɔni ni ngmami ngɛ zugba kɛ e nine nguɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Se benɛ a ngɛ nɔ ngɛ lɛ bie ke e ha mɛ heto ɔ, e wo e he nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “E da. Nyɛ ma nyɛ maa fiaa lɛ tɛ ɔ kɛ ya si e ma gbo, se nyɛ ti nɔ nɛ pee we yayami ko hyɛ ɔ, lɛ kekle e fia lɛ tɛ ɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e ma e yi si ekohu nɛ e bɔni ni ɔ ngmami ngɛ zugba. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Benɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ nu munyu nɛ ɔ, a bɔni lejɛ ɔ jemi kakaaka, kɛ je a nɔkɔtɔma a nɔ kɛ ya si sekpɛ nɔ ɔ nɔ, nɛ e ba piɛ Yesu nɔ kake kɛ yo ɔ pɛ ngɛ asafo ɔ hɛ mi.<verse eid="JHN 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu wo e he no ekohu nɛ e bi yo ɔ ke, “Jije o nya poli ɔmɛ ngɛ? Anɛ a ti nɔ ko bui mo fɔ lo?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Yo ɔ he nɔ ke, “Mawetsɛ, nɔ ko bui mi fɔ.” Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Lɛɛ ami hu i bui mo fɔ mɔ; moo ya nɛ o ko ya pee yayami hu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Pee se ɔ, Yesu de ni ɔmɛ ke, “Ami ji je ɔ La a nɛ, ke nyɛ nyɛɛ ye se ɔ nyɛ be nɔ́ tɛe ngɛ diblii mi, ejakaa wami la a ma kpɛ ngɛ nyɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Farisi bi ɔmɛ he nɔ nɛ a de lɛ ke, “O ngɛ fiae, nɔ́ nɛ o ngɛ dee ɔ be mi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “E ngɛ mi kaa ami nitsɛ ye he odase i ngɛ yee mohu, se e ji anɔkuale odase, ejakaa i le he nɛ i je kɛ he nɛ i yaa, se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ li enɛ ɔ ngɛ ye he. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nɛ nyɛ ngɛ mi fɔ bue be mi nɛ nyɛ li anɔkuale ɔ. Ami lɛɛ i kojo we nɔ ko amlɔ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Se ke i ma kojo nɔ ko ɔ, mu ko be ye kojomi ɔ he hie, ejakaa i kɛ Tsɛ ɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ nɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Nyɛ mlaa amɛ tsɔɔ kaa ke ni enyɔ ye nɔ́ ko he odase ɔ, a ngɔɔ a odase yemi ɔ kaa anɔkuale odase. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Saminya, ami ji odase kake, nɛ ye Tsɛ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ ji odase enyɔne ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Nɛ a bi Yesu ke, “Jije o tsɛ ɔ ngɛ?” Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Nyɛ li nɔ nɛ i ji, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ li nɔ nɛ ji ye Tsɛ ɔ hulɔ. A ke nyɛ le mi jinɛ nyɛ ko le ye Tsɛ ɔ hulɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nihi fuu bɔni Yesu munyu ɔ sisi numi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu tu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ he nɛ a toɔ sika ngɛ ɔ, se a nui lɛ ejakaa e be ɔ sui lolo.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Pee se ɔ Yesu de mɛ ekohu ke, “Ma si nyɛ, nɛ nyɛ ma hla mi, nɛ nyɛ ma gbo ngɛ nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ a mi. He nɛ i yaa lɛɛ nyɛ be nyɛe lejɛ ɔ maa ba.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ bi ke, “Anɛ e yaa gbe e he lo? Mɛni e ngɛ dee ɔ ke, ‘He nɛ i yaa a nyɛ be lejɛ ɔ nyɛe maa ba’ a?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ lɛɛ sisi hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ je, se ami lɛɛ i je hiɔwe. Je nɛ ɔ mi bimɛ ji nyɛ, se ami lɛɛ tsa pi je nɛ ɔ mi no ji mi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke nyɛ ma gbo ngɛ nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ a mi ɔ nɛ, ja nyɛ he ye kaa ami ji Mesia a, Mawu Bi ɔ, ke pi ja a nyɛ maa tlɔ nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ a mi kɛ gbo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />A bi lɛ ke, “Moo tsɔɔ wɔ nɔ nɛ o ji.” Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Ami ji nɔ nɛ i deɔ nyɛ daa ke i ji ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />I ngɛ he blɔ nɛ i kojoɔ nyɛ ngɛ níhi fuu a he, nɛ i tsɔɔ nyɛ níhi fuu, se i be pee ejakaa nɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ, anɔkualetsɛ i nɛ nɔ́ nɛ e de mi ɔ, lɔ ɔ pɛ i deɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Se loloolo ɔ a nui sisi kaa Tsɛ ɔ he munyu e kɛ mɛ ngɛ tue ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ja a he ɔ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Ke nyɛ gbe Mesia a, lɔ ɔ loko nyɛ maa na kaa ami i; nɛ nyɛ maa na hu kaa tsa pi ami nitsɛ ye juɛmi mi munyu nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ tue ɔ, se mohu nɔ́ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ tsɔɔ mi ɔ i. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Nɛ nɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ kɛ mi ngɛ, e si we mi, ejakaa i peeɔ e bua nɔ nɔ́ daa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ nu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, he lɛ ye kaa lɛ ji Mesia a nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Ke nyɛ ba nyɛ je mi kaa bɔ nɛ i ngɛ hlae ɔ, lɛɛ ye kaseli ji nyɛ ngɛ anɔkuale mi, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />nɛ nyɛ maa le anɔkuale ɔ, nɛ anɔkuale ɔ ma ha nyɛ maa ye nyɛ he.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Se a de ke, “Wɔɔ lɛɛ Abraham weku ɔ mi wa je, nɛ wa pi nɔ ko nyɔguɛ ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ. Mɛni o ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa, ‘Nyɛ maa ye nyɛ he’ ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu he nɔ ke, “Yayami nyɔguɛ ji nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Nɛ nyɔguɛ be blɔ nya ko, se Bi ɔ lɛɛ he blɔ fɛɛ he blɔ nɛ ngɛ ɔ, e nɔ i. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke Bi ɔ ha nyɛ ye nyɛ he ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ ye nyɛ he niinɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />I na le kaa Abraham weku ɔ mi bimɛ ji nyɛ mohu, se kɛ ɔ nyɛ ti ni komɛ ngɛ mi hlae nɛ a gbe, ejakaa ye munyu ɔ sɛ we a tsui mi. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />I ngɛ nyɛ níhi nɛ i na ngɛ ye Tsɛ he ɔ dee, se nyɛ hu nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ tsɛ ɔ gbi nɔ yee.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />A he nɔ ke, “Wa tsɛ ji Abraham.” Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Dabi! A ke Abraham bimɛ ji nyɛ jinɛ nyɛ ngɛ e ni tsumi kpakpa amɛ tsue. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Se mohu ɔ nyɛ ngɛ ye se blɔ hlae nɛ nyɛɛ gbe mi, ejakaa i de nyɛ anɔkuale ɔ nɛ i nu ngɛ Mawu nya a; Abraham be enɛ ɔ pee. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ke nyɛ tsu ni tsumi kaa kikɛ ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ tsɛ ɔ gbi nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ yee.” A he nɔ ke, “A fɔ we wɔ ngɛ ajuama bɔmi mi, Mawu nitsɛ ji wa tsɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “A ke Mawu ji nyɛ tse jinɛ nyɛ maa suɔ ye sane, ejakaa Mawu ngɔ i je kɛ ba. I bɛ ngɛ ami nitsɛ ye he wami nya, se mohu lɛ nɛ e tsɔ mi. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ nui ye munyu ɔ sisi ɔ? Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa a ngɛ nyɛ nya tsie nɛ nyɛ ko nu sisi. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Ejakaa Abosiami bimɛ ji nyɛ, ja a he ɔ nyɛ suɔ nɛ nyɛ tsu ni tsumi yaya amɛ nɛ e tsuɔ ɔ. Nɔmlɔ gbelɔ ji lɛ kɛ je blema, nɛ e sume anɔkuale, ejakaa anɔkuale be e mi. Ke e ye lakpa a, mu ko be he, ejakaa lakpatsɛ ji lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke i tu anɔkuale ɔ, nyɛ he we yi.<verse eid="JHN 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Nyɛ ti mɛnɔ ma nyɛ po ye nya ngɛ yayami ko he? Nɛ ke i ngɛ nyɛ anɔkuale ɔ tue ɔ, mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ he we mi yi mɔ? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Nɔ nɛ Mawu bi ji lɛ ɔ, e buɔ Mawu munyu tue kɛ bua jɔmi, se akɛnɛ nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ bui lɛ tue he je ɔ, tsa pi e bimɛ ji nyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ he nɔ nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Samaria no! Nubwɔ! Anɛ wa de we mwɔnɛ ɔ ke mumi yayami ngɛ o mi lo?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu he nɔ ke, “Mumi yayami be ye mi, ejakaa i ngɛ ye Tsɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami woe, se nyɛɛ lɛɛ ye he guɛ nyɛ ngɛ gbee. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nɛ e ngɛ mi kaa i hla we nɛ ma pee ye he agbo mohu, se Mawu ngɛ hlae nɛ e pee mi ja, nɛ e maa kojo nihi nɛ kua mi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi kaa nɔ nɛ heɔ mi yeɔ ɔ, e be gboe gblee.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ de lɛ ke, “Kpaako wa na le kaa mumi yayami ngɛ o mi tutuutu. Abraham kɛ gbali ngua amɛ po gbo; nɛ moo lɛɛ o deɔ ke nɔ nɛ heɔ o nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e be gboe gbleegbleegblee ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Anɛ o kle pe wa tsɛ Abraham kɛ gbali ɔmɛ nɛ gbo ɔ lo? Mɛnɔ ji mo?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Ke fiami nɛ i ngɛ fiae ɔ, fiami gu i. Se ye Tsɛ nɛ nyɛ deɔ ke nyɛ Mawu ji lɛ ɔ, ji nɔ nɛ ngɛ enɛ ɔmɛ dee kɛ ngɛ ye hɛ mi nyami woe ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Se nyɛ li lɛ tete. Ami lɛɛ i le lɛ, nɛ ke i de nyɛ nɔ kpa a, lɛɛ i peeɔ lakpatsɛ kaa nyɛ. Se anɔkuale ɔ nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ tue. I le lɛ, nɛ i yeɔ e gbi nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Nyɛ tsɛ Abraham hla kɛ bua jɔmi kaa e ko na ye bami ɔ. E le kaa i ma, nɛ e bua jɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ de lɛ ke, “O yi jeha nyingmi enuɔ tete lolo nɛ o na Abraham lo?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu he nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, i ngɛ loko a fɔ Abraham.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ miɔ nɛ a fiaa lɛ tɛ nɛ a gbe lɛ, se Yesu laa e he nɛ e si Sɔlemi We ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsa hɛ yuyuilɔ ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Benɛ Yesu yaa a, e na nyumu ko nɛ e hɛ yu kɛ je e fɔmi mi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ bi lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, mɛni he je nɛ a fɔ nyumu nɛ ɔ hɛ yuyuilɔ ɔ? Anɛ lɛ nitsɛ nɛ e pee yayami aloo e fɔli a yayami nɛ a pee he je i?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu ha mɛ heto ke; “Tsa pi a ti nɔ ko nɛ pee yayami ko, se mohu e ba mi ja bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a je Mawu he wami ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />E sa nɛ wɔ tsuo waa gbe ni tsumi nɛ nɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ ha wɔ ɔ nya mla, ejakaa e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ du ma bu nɛ a be ni tsue hu. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Se be abɔ nɛ i ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, je ɔ kane ji mi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu la lada kɛ pue si nɛ e ngɔ kɛ pɔtɔ zu nɛ e kɛ kpa nyumu ɔ hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ; <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Yaa nɛ o ya du o he ngɛ Siloam Taku ɔ mi,” nɛ Siloam sisi ji nɔ nɛ a tsɔ lɛ. Nyumu ɔ ho ya du ngɛ taku ɔ mi nɛ e kpale kɛ ba nɛ e bɔni nɔ hyɛmi.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Se e huɛmɛ kɛ nihi nɛ le lɛ kaa hɛ yuyuilɔ kɛ ni balɔ ɔ, bi a he ke, “Anɛ tsa pi nɔmlɔ ɔ nɛ baa ni ɔ ji nɛ ɔ lo?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Nɛ ni komɛ de ke lɛ i, ni komɛ hu ke tsa pi lɛ i. Nɛ a susu ke, “E be nyɛe maa pee lɛ nɔuu i. Se mohu e je jamɛ a ni balɔ ɔ nɛ hyɛ we nɔ́ ɔ.” Kɛkɛ nɛ nyumu ɔ nitsɛ de mɛ ke, “Ami nɔuu i.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />A bi lɛ bɔ nɛ e ba ha nɛ e bɔni nɔ́ hyɛmi.<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yesu ɔ nɛ pɔtɔ zu nɛ e kɛ kpa ye hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ ha mi nɛ e de mi ke ma ho nɛ ma ya du ye he ngɛ Siloam Taku ɔ mi. I ye e gbi ɔ nɔ, nɛ i bɔni nɔ hyɛmi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Jije e ngɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ?” E de mɛ ke, “I li.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kpaka lɛ kɛ ho Farisi bi ɔmɛ a ngɔ ya. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Se Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ nɛ Yesu tsu ni nɛ ɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Farisi bi ɔmɛ kpale bi lɛ bɔ nɛ e ba ha loko e bɔni nɔ́ hyɛmi ɔ. Nɛ e bɔ mɛ bɔ nɛ Yesu ngɔ mɔsɔ ɔ kɛ kpa e hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ bɔ nɛ e ha e ya du nɛ e bɔni nɔ hyɛmi ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Nɛ a ti ni komɛ de ke, “Kikɛmɛ a Yesu nɛ ɔ, lɛɛ tsa pi Mawu ngɔ nɛ e je mɔ, ejakaa e yi Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ.” A ti ni komɛ hu de ke, “Anɛ yayami peelɔ ko ma nyɛ tsu nyakpɛ ni tsumi kaa enɛ ɔ lo?” Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ mi gbami ba a kpɛti. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Farisi bi ɔmɛ bi nyumu nɔ nɛ a tsa lɛ ɔ ke, “Mo nɛɛ, nɔmlɔ nɛ bli o hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, mɛnɔ ji lɛ?” E ha mɛ heto ke, “E peeɔ mi kaa Mawu gbalɔ ji lɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ he we lɛ yi. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ a ya tsɛ e fɔli kɛ ba; <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />nɛ a ba bi mɛ ke, “Nyɛ binyumu ɔ ji nɛ ɔ lo? Anɛ pi hɛ yuyuilɔ ji lɛ nɛ nyɛ fɔ lo? Ke ja a, lɛɛ mɛni ba loko jehanɛ ɔ e bɔni nɔ hyɛmi ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />E fɔli ɔmɛ ha mɛ heto ke, “Wa le kaa wa binyumu ɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, nɛ wa fɔ lɛ hɛ yuyuilɔ, <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />se wali nɔ nɛ ba nɛ e bɔni nɔ́ hyɛmi, nɛ wa li nɔ nɛ bli e hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ hulɔ. E wa, nɛ e le munyu tumi. Nyɛ bi lɛ nitsɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22-23" />Gbeye yemi nya nɛ fɔli ɔmɛ de Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ enɛ ɔ ngɛ, ejakaa a ha nɛ a le kaa nɔ nɛ ma de ke Kristo ɔ ji Mesia a, a maa fie lɛ kɛ je asafo ɔ mi.<verse eid="JHN 9:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Farisi bi ɔmɛ tsɛ nyumu ɔ nɛ a tsa lɛ ɔ ekohu nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Mo wo hɛ mi nyami ɔ kɛ ha Mawu. Mo ko wo kɛ ha Yesu, ejakaa wa le Yesu ɔ kaa yayami peelɔ ji lɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Se nyumu ɔ de mɛ ke, “Ami lɛɛ i li kaa kpakpa loo yayami peelɔ ji lɛ. Nɔ nɛ pɛ nɛ i le ji, i hyɛ we nɔ́ kɛ je ye fɔmi be mi, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, i ngɛ nɔ́ hyɛe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Nɛ a bi lɛ ekohu ke, “Mɛni e pee? Kɛ e pee kɛ bli o hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ kɛɛ?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />E ha mɛ heto ke, “Ei! I de nyɛ mo nɛ nyɛ bui tue. Mɛni nyɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ ma de nyɛ ekohu? Anɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ plɛ e se nyɛɛli lo?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Se a jɛ lɛ nɛ a de ke, “Mo ji e se nyɛɛlɔ, wɔɔ lɛɛ Mose se nyɛɛli ji wɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Wa le kaa Mawu kɛ Mose tu munyu, se nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ lɛɛ wa li e he nɔ́ ko.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Nyumu ɔ de mɛ ke, “Ei! E ngɛ nyakpɛ kaa nyɛ li e he nɔ́ ko. E nyɛɛ tsaa hɛ yuyuili, nɛ nyɛ ke nyɛ li e he nɔ́ ko! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Mawu bui yayami peeli tue, se e buɔ nihi nɛ jaa lɛ, nɛ a peeɔ e suɔmi nya ni ɔ tue. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kɛ je benɛ a bɔ je ɔ, a nui kaa nɔ ko nyɛ nɛ e tsa nɔ ko nɛ e hɛ yu kɛ je e fɔmi mi gblee. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ke pi Mawu ngɔ nɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ je ɔ, e be nyɛe kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔ ma tsu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />A hwɔ e yi nɛ a de ke, “Mo nɛ a fɔ ngɛ yayami mi ɔ, mo nɛ o ngɛ wɔ ni tsɔɔe nɛ ɔ?” Kɛkɛ nɛ a fie lɛ kɛ je lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Benɛ Yesu nu nɔ́ nɛ ɔ he nɛ e na nyumu ɔ, e bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ o heɔ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ nɔ yeɔ lo?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Nyumu ɔ he nɔ ke, “Mawetsɛ, mɛnɔ ji lɛ, ejakaa i ngɛ hlae nɛ ma he e nɔ ma ye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “O na lɛ, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ kɛ mo ngɛ munyu tue ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nyumu ɔ de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, i he ye.” Nɛ e kpla si nɛ e ja lɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “I ba je ɔ mi konɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ hyɛ we nɔ́ ngɛ mumi blɔ fa mi ɔ, a hyɛ nɔ, nɛ ma tsɔɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ susuu kaa a ngɛ nɔ́ hyɛe ɔ kaa hɛ yuyuili ji mɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Farisi bi ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, a ti ni komɛ bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ o ngɛ dee ke wɔ hu wa hɛ yu lo?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “A ke nyɛ hɛ yu jinɛ nyɛ be fɔ yee. Se nyɛ fɔ yemi ɔ ngɛ kɛ sa, ejakaa nyɛ deɔ ke nyɛ le nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ pee ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ji Tohyɛlɔ Kpakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ gui agbo ɔ nya, se e tuu gbogbo ɔ kɛ sɛɛ to tsu ɔ mi ɔ, julɔ ji lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ejakaa to hyɛlɔ ɔ agbo ɔ nya nɛ e guu. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Agbo nya bulɔ ɔ bliɔ agbo ɔ haa lɛ nɛ e sɛɛ mi. To ɔmɛ nuɔ e gbi nɛ a baa e ngɔ. E tsɛɔ e to ɔmɛ kɛ a biɛhi, nɛ e kpakaa mɛ kɛ jee kpo. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />E nyɛɛ a hɛ mi, nɛ a nyɛɛ e se, ejakaa a le e gbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />A nyɛɛ we nɔ kpa ko se, se mohu a tuɔ nɔ kpa nya fo ejakaa a li e gbi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Nihi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nui abɛ nɛ Yesu bu ɔ sisi. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e je sisi ha mɛ ke, “Ami ji Agbo kɛ ha to ɔmɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Juli kɛ ojo fiali ji nihi nɛ nyɛɛ ye hɛ mi ɔ nɛ, nɛ to kpakpa amɛ bui mɛ tue. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Ami ji Agbo ɔ nɛ; nɔ nɛ guu ye mi kɛ sɛɛ mi ɔ, a ma he e yi wami. E maa sɛ mi nɛ e maa je kpo, nɛ e ma na niye ni kpakpa. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Julɔ ɔ lɛɛ e baa ngɛ jumi kɛ nɔ gbemi kɛ nɔ́ puɛmi he. Ami kɛ i ba nɛ ma ha a na neneene wami nɛ e hyi fuu.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Ami ji Tohyɛlɔ Kpakpa a nɛ. Tohyɛlɔ Kpakpa a ngɔɔ e he kɛ saa afɔle ngɛ to ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />To hyɛlɔ nɛ ji apaatsɛ ɔ tuu fo kɛ siɔ to ɔmɛ ke e na ogbetee nɛ ma, nɛ e jee a he, ejakaa tsa pi e níhi ji mɛ, e pi a hyɛlɔ hulɔ. Nɛ ogbetee ɔ baa nɛ e ba gbɛɛ mɛ kɛ woɔ nga. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Apaatsɛ ɔ tuu fo kɛ siɔ to ɔmɛ ejakaa apaa kɛkɛ nɛ a bɔ lɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, to ɔmɛ a he pee we lɛ kɔmɔ tsɔ.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Ami ji Tohyɛlɔ Kpakpa a nɛ, nɛ i le ye to ɔmɛ nɛ mɛ hu a le mi; <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />kaa bɔ nɛ ye Tsɛ ɔ le mi nɛ ami hu i le lɛ ɔ, nɛ i ngɔɔ ye wami kɛ saa afɔle ngɛ to ɔmɛ a he ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />I ngɛ to kpa komɛ hu nɛ a be to nɛ ɔmɛ a kpɛti. I ma ya kpaka mɛ hu kɛ ba nɛ mɛ hu a maa nu ye gbi.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Ye Tsɛ ɔ suɔ mi, ejakaa i ngɔ ye wami kɛ fɔ si, nɛ ye nine maa su nɔ ekohu. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Tsa pi nɔ ko nɛ kpɔ ye wami ɔ ngɛ ye dɛ, se ami nitsɛ nɛ i kɛ ha. Ejakaa i ngɛ he blɔ kɛ he wami nɛ i ngɔɔ ye wami ɔ kɛ fɔɔ si be nɛ i suɔ, nɛ i kpaleɔ ngɔɔ lɛ ekohu. Ye Tsɛ ɔ nɛ ha mi he blɔ nɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Munyu nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ e tu ɔ ha mi gbami ba Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ a kpɛti ekohu ngɛ e he. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />A ti ni komɛ de ke, “Mumi yayami ngɛ e mi aloo e ngɛ godo nue. Mɛni he je e sa kaa a bu Nɔmlɔ kaa kikɛ ɔ tue?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ni komɛ hu de ke, “Nɔmlɔ nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ e mi be kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔmɛ tue. Anɛ nɔ nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ e mi ma nyɛ bli nihi nɛ a hɛ yu ɔ a hɛ ngmɛ lo?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">“Mo de wɔ anɔkuale ɔ paa”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Yesu ya Yerusalem ngɛ fiɛ be mi ngɛ Sɔlemi Tsu ɔ nya blimi he; <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />nɛ e ya slaa si ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ he ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Solomo Ablanaa a nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ ba bɔle lɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni be kulaa nɛ o ma de wɔ anɔkuale ɔ? Ke mo ji Kristo ɔ, mo de wɔ paa koo!”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Tsɛ i de nyɛ momo nɛ nyɛ he we yi. Okadihi nɛ i ngɛ pee ngɛ ye Tsɛ ɔ biɛ mi ɔ ji níhi nɛ ngɛ ye he odase yee, se nyɛ he we yi. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Nyɛ he we mi yi ejakaa tsa pi ye to ɔmɛ ekomɛ ji nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ye to ɔmɛ nuɔ ye gbi nɛ i le mɛ hulɔ nɛ a nyɛɔ ye se. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />I haa mɛ neneene wami nɛ a hɛ mi be kpatae gblee. Nɔ ko be mɛ nyɛe ma kpɔ ngɛ ye de, <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />ejakaa ye Tsɛ nɛ ngɔ mɛ kɛ ha mi ɔ ngɛ he wami pe nɔ tsuaa nɔ, ja a he ɔ nɔ ko be mɛ nyɛe ma kpɔ ngɛ ye dɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Ami kɛ ye Tsɛ ɔ nɔ kake ji wɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ kukuɔ tɛ ke a ma kɛ fiaa lɛ nɛ a gbe lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Se Yesu bi mɛ ke, “Ngɛ Mawu blɔ tsɔɔmi nya a, i tsu ni tsumi kpakpahi babauu nɛ ma kɛ ye kɛ bua ni ɔmɛ. Ni tsumi nɛ ɔmɛ a ti te nɔ́ nɛ he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛɛ gbe mi ngɛ nɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />A he nɔ nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Tsa pi ni tsumi kpakpa ko nɛ o tsu he nɛ wa ngɛ mo tɛ fiae ngɛ, se mohu ngɛ musu bɔmi he je, ejakaa nɔmlɔ adesa ji mo se o ngɛ o he tsɛe ke Mawu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ mlaa ko tsɔɔ kaa mawuhi ji nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Ke anɔkuale Ngmami ɔ tsɛɔ nihi nɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ ba a ngɔ ɔ ke mawuhi, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />nɔ nɛ Mawu pee lɛ Klɔuklɔu nɛ e tsɔ lɛ kɛ ba je ɔ mi hu de ke, ‘Ami ji Mawu Bi ɔ’, anɛ enɛ ɔ peeɔ musu bɔmi munyu lo? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Nyɛ ko he mi ye ke i tsu we Mawu nyakpɛ ni tsumi ko. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Se ke i tsu nyakpɛ ni tsumihi ɔ, nyɛ he nyɛɛ ye, ke nyɛ he we ami yi tete. Enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa Tsɛ ɔ ngɛ ye mi, nɛ ami hu i ngɛ Tsɛ ɔ mi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ bɔ mɔde kaa a maa nu lɛ ekohu se e je a kpɛti zaa, <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />kɛ ho Yordan Pa a se he nɛ Yohane baptisi nihi ngɛ kekle ɔ ya nɛ e ya hi lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Nɛ nihi babauu nyɛɛ e se nɛ a de a he ke, “Yohane pee we okadi ko, se nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e de ngɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ he ɔ ba mi pɛpɛɛpɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Nɛ nihi fuu he ye kaa lɛ ji Mesia a nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lazaro gbenɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1-2" />O kai Maria nɔ nɛ kɛ nu je via pue Yesu nanehi a nɔ nɛ e kɛ e yi bwɔmi tsu a he ɔ lo? E nyɛminyumu nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ Lazaro nɛ je Betania, he nɛ e kɛ Maria kɛ e nyɛmi Marta a ngɛ ɔ, ngɛ hiɔ nue. <verse eid="JHN 11:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ e nyɛmiyi ɔmɛ tsɔ nɛ a ya de Yesu ke, “Mawetsɛ, o huɛ nɛ o suɔ lɛ saminya a, e ngɛ gbenɔ muɔ nya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Se benɛ Yesu nu enɛ ɔ, e de ke, “Tsa pi gbenɔ hiɔ nɛ e ngɛ nue se mohu bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami, nɛ ami Mawu Bi ɔ hu ye hɛ mi nɛ ba nyami kɛ gu enɛ ɔ mi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />E ji anɔkuale kaa Yesu suɔ Marta kɛ Maria kɛ Lazaro sane mohu, se benɛ e nu Lazaro hiɔ ɔ he ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />e yɛ amlɔ ɔ nɛ e ya hyɛ ha. Se e ye ligbi enyɔ sɔuu ngɛ he nɛ e ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Ligbi enyɔ ɔ se loko e de kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha nɛ waa ho Yudea ya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Se e kaseli ɔmɛ kplɛɛ we nɔ. A de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, be bɔɔ ko ji nɛ ɔ nɛ Yudea nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ Yuda a ka mo gbemi. Anɛ o yaa lejɛ ɔ ekohu lo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Se Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Ngmlɛfia nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ nɛ ngɛ je nanɛɛ mi, kɛ je mɔtu kɛ ya si gbɔkuɛ mi daa ligbi. Nɛ ke nɔ ko nyɛɛ ngɛ ngmlɛfia nɛ ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, e tɛ we nɔ, ejakaa je ɔ mi tɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Nyɔ mi nɛ a tɛɔ nɔ, ejakaa diblii wo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Wa huɛ Lazaro hwɔ mahe nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ i yaa nɛ ma ya tsiɛ lɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Se e kaseli ɔmɛ susu kaa nɔ nɛ e ngɛ tsɔɔe ji Lazaro ngɛ e he jɔɔe, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ a de Yesu ke, “Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa e na he wami saii.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Se Yesu lɛɛ nɔ nɛ e ngɛ tsɔɔe ji Lazaro gbo.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Jehanɛ ɔ Yesu de mɛ paa ke, “Lazaro gbo. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Nɛ ngɛ nyɛ he je ɔ, e ngɔ ye nya kaa i be lejɛ ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ he ye nɔ nyɛɛ ye. Nyɛɛ te si nɛ waa ho lejɛ ɔ ya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Toma nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ “Hawi” ɔ de e nyɛmimɛ kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha waa kɛ lɛ nɛ ya nɛ waa kɛ lɛ nɛ ya gbo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Benɛ a ya su Betania a, a de mɛ ke Lazaro ye ligbi eywiɛ sɔuu ngɛ gbogboe muɔ ɔ mi momo. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Betania kɛ Yerusalem kpɛti kɛ we. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Ja a he je ɔ, Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ fuu ba Betania nɛ a ba ye Marta kɛ Maria kɔmɔ ngɛ a nyɛmi ɔ gbenɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Benɛ Marta na kaa Yesu ma a, e ya kpee lɛ ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ, se Maria lɛɛ e tlɔ si ngɛ we ɔ mi.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Nɛ Marta de Yesu ke, “Mawetsɛ, a ke o ngɛ hiɛ ɔ jinɛ ye nyɛmi ɔ ko gbo we. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ hu be bi, ejakaa i le kaa Mawu maa kpale ye nyɛmi ɔ kɛ ba wami mi ke o bi lɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “O nyɛminyumu ɔ maa te si kɛ ba wami mi ekohu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marta he nɔ ke, “I le kaa e maa te si ngɛ ni gbogboehi a si temi ligbi ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Se Yesu de lɛ ke, “Ami ji nɔ nɛ tleɔ ni gbogboehi si kɛ jee gbeje kɛ baa wami mi ɔ nɛ. Nɔ nɛ heɔ ye nɔ yeɔ ɔ, ke e gbo tete po ɔ, e ma na wami ekohu. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ ye nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e be gboe gbleegbleegblee. Marta, o heɔ enɛ ɔ yeɔ lo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Marta he nɔ ke, “Ee, Mawetsɛ, i he ye kaa mo ji Mesia a, Mawu Bi nɛ wa ngɛ lɛ blɔ hyɛe ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Marta je lejɛ ɔ nɛ e ya tsɛ e nyɛmi Maria kɛ ba se nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ ɔ ba hiɛ ɔ nɛ e ngɛ mo hlae.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Nɛ Maria te si amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ e ba e ngɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tle Lazaro si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Yesu sɛ we kɔpe ɔ mi. E ngɛ he nɛ Marta kɛ lɛ ba kpe ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Benɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ ba ngɛ Maria kɔmɔ yee ɔ na lɛ nɛ e je kpo ɔ, a susu kaa e yaa nɛ e ya fo ya ngɛ he nɛ a pu e nyɛmi ɔ ngɛ ɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a fie e se.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Benɛ Maria ya su he nɛ Yesu ngɛ ɔ, e kpla si nɛ e nu e nane nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, a ke o ngɛ hiɛ ɔ jinɛ ye nyɛmi ɔ ko gbo we.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Benɛ Yesu na bɔ nɛ Maria ngɛ ya foe, nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ hu ngɛ kɔmɔ yee kɛ piɛ e he ɔ, e kuɛ ngmɛ bɛ, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Jije nɛ a pu lɛ ngɛ.” Nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, ba nɛ o ba hyɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Nɛ Yesu fo ya.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ de ke, “Huɛhi ji mɛ niinɛ. Hyɛ bɔ nɛ e suɔ lɛ ha?”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Se a ti ni komɛ hu de ke, “Nyumu nɛ ɔ nɛ tsa hɛ yuyuilɔ ɔ, mɛni he je e nyɛ we Lazaro nɛ e tsa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu ye aywilɛho ngɛ e mi ekohu. Jehanɛ ɔ, a ba su yɔkɔ ɔ he. E ji tɛ muɔ nɛ a ngɔ tɛ agbo kɛ tsi nya.<verse eid="JHN 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ tsitsɛɛ tɛ ɔ kɛ ya se.” Se Marta nɛ ji Lazaro nyɛmiyo ɔ de Yesu ke, “Mawetsɛ, be nɛ ɔ mi ɔ e maa sa, ejakaa e ye ligbi eywiɛ sɔuu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Se Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ i de we mo ke ke o he ye ɔ, o maa na Mawu nyakpɛ okadi ko lo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a tsitsɛɛ tɛ ɔ kɛ ya se, nɛ Yesu wo e hɛ nɔ nɛ e de ke, “Tsaatsɛ, i naa mo si kaa o bu mi tue. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />I le kaa o buɔ mi tue daa, se i ngɛ enɛ ɔ dee bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ nɛ a he ye kaa mo nɛ o tsɔ mi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e hia ngmlaa nɛ e de ke, “Lazaro, moo je kpo!”<verse eid="JHN 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ Lazaro je kpo kɛ e he bo nɛ a kɛ pu lɛ ɔ, kɛ duku nɛ a kɛ fi e hɛ mi ɔ. Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ pine ní ɔmɛ ha lɛ nɛ e ya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Jehanɛ ɔ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ a ti nihi nɛ ba Maria kɔmɔ yemi ɔ, benɛ a na nɔ́ nɛ Yesu pee ɔ, a he e nɔ ye. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Se a ti ni komɛ je lejɛ ɔ nɛ a ya bɔ Farisi bi ɔmɛ amaniɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ tsɛ kpe nɛ a susu nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ he. Kɛkɛ nɛ a bi a he ke, “Kɛ wa ngɛ pee kɛɛ? Ejakaa nyumu nɛ ɔ ngɛ nyakpɛ nihi pee niinɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Nɛ ke wa ngmɛ lɛ blɔ ɔ, ma a tsuo maa nyɛɛ e se, nɛ Roma soja amɛ ma ba gbe wɔ nɛ a maa ngɔ Yuda ma a.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Se a ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛ lɛ ke Kaiafa nɛ lɛ ji osɔfo ngua jamɛ a jeha a de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ke nyɛ li nɔ́ ko kulaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Anɛ nyɛ susuu we kaa e sa nɛ nɔ kake nɛ gbo ngɛ ma a nane mi pe nɛ ma a tsuo hɛ mi ma kpata lo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />A gba momo kaa Yesu ma gbo ngɛ ma a nane mi. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ pi Kaiafa nitsɛ e yi mi tomi munyu nɛ e tu ɔ, se mohu a kɛ wo e nya nɛ e de, akɛnɛ lɛ ji Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Nɛ si womi ɔ tsɔɔ kaa tsa pi Israel bi kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu ma gbo ha, se mohu e ma gbo bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e bua Mawu bimɛ nɛ gbɛ wo je ɔ mi tsuo nya. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ja a he je ɔ, Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ bɔni Yesu gbemi he ga tomi.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Enɛ ɔ ha Yesu jɔɔ fiɛmi paa ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ e si Yerusalem kɛ ba Efraim nga a nya kɔpe ko mi, nɛ e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ba hi lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a Hebemi jeha yemi ɔ su ta. Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ nihi fuu je kɔpekɔpe ɔmɛ a mi kɛ ba Yerusalem nɛ a ba tsukɔ a he loko Hebemi Ligbi ɔ nɛ su. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ Yesu hlae nɛ e na. Nɛ benɛ a ngɛ sieku yee ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, a bi a he ke, “Anɛ e maa ba Hebemi kaimi ɔ lo?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Se jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ ha lemi kaa ke nɔ ko na Yesu ɔ, e ha nɛ a le nɔuu konɛ a ya nu lɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">I kɛ nyɛ be si hie kɛ ya kɛkɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Benɛ e piɛ ligbi ekpa nɛ a maa ye Hebemi Ligbi ɔ, Yesu ba Betania he nɛ e tle Lazaro si kɛ je gbeje ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />A ngmɛ Yesu okplɔɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ Marta sɔmɔ lɛ, nɛ Lazaro hu piɛ a he ngɛ okplɔɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Maria wo nu je via tɔ kake nɛ he jua wa saminya kɛ kpa Yesu nanehi a he nɛ e kɛ e yi bwɔmi tsu, nɛ nu ɔ he via a kpe we ɔ mi tsuo.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Se Yuda Iskariot nɛ ji e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ maa tsɔɔ Yesu se blɔ ɔ de ke, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Nu je via nɛ ɔ he jua wa, nɛ e sa nɛ a jua lɛ nɛ a ngɔ sika a kɛ ha ohiafo ɔmɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Se tsa pi ohiafo ɔmɛ a he nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ lɛ dɔe, se lɛ ji kaseli ɔmɛ a sika tolɔ nɛ e juɔ sika nɛ a kɛ ha lɛ si tomi ɔ eko.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Moo ngmɛɛ e he, e pee enɛ ɔ kɛ to ye pumi ligbi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Nyɛ ma nyɛ ye kɛ bua ohiafo ɔmɛ daa, se ami lɛɛ pi daa nɛ i kɛ nyɛ maa hi si.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Benɛ Yerusalem bi ɔmɛ nu kaa Yesu ba lejɛ ɔ, a ba nɛ a ba hyɛ e kɛ Lazaro, nɔ nɛ e tle si kɛ je gbeje ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ pee a juɛmi kaa a maa gbe Lazaro hu kɛ piɛ e he, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ejakaa e he je nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ a ti nihi fuu he Yesu nɔ ye kaa lɛ ji a Mesia a nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yerusalem sɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />E nɔ jena a, a nu ngɛ Yerusalem he tsuaa he kaa Yesu ma. Nɛ nihi fuu nɛ ba Hebemi ɔ yemi hyɛmi ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />ku ta bahi kɛ ya kpee lɛ ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ a kpa ngmlaa nɛ a de ke, “Hosiana, Mawu nɛ gbaa Israel Matsɛ ɔ. A gbaa Mawu tsɔlɔ ɔ nɛ ma a!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Nɛ Yesu kuɔ teji bi kaa bɔ nɛ a gba a ke, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Koo ye gbeye Israel, ejakaa o matsɛ ɔ ma o ngɔ kɛ he si bami, nɛ e hi teji bi nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Se e kaseli ɔmɛ nui ni nɛ ɔmɛ a sisi jamɛ a be ɔ mi kaa si ko nɛ a wo ɔ nɛ ngɛ mi bae. Se benɛ Yesu kpale kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ngɛ e anunyami ɔ mi loko a kai kaa a de níhi fuu ngɛ Ngmami ɔ mi ngɛ e he, nɛ a ba mi, nɛ a na kɛ a hɛ ngmɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ nihi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ benɛ Yesu tle Lazaro si kɛ je gbeje ɔ ye he odase kɛ tsɔɔ ni kpa amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ nihi fuu ya kpee lɛ ngɛ, ejakaa a nu nyakpɛ nɔ́ agbo nɛ ɔ nɛ e tsu ɔ he.<verse eid="JHN 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ de a he ke, “Wa pee ta; nyɛ nɛ je ɔ tsuo ngɛ e se nyɛɛe!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Hela bi komɛ nɛ ba Yerusalem ngɛ Hebemi ɔ yemi ɔ he ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />ya Filipo nɛ je Galilea ma ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Betsaida a ngɔ, nɛ a ya de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, wa maa suɔ nɛ waa na Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Nɛ Filipo ya de Andrea, nɛ mɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ a ya de Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Be nɛ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa kpale kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ngɛ e anunyami ɔ mi su. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Nɛ ja i nɔ si nɛ i gbo kaa blɛfo ngu sɛɛ zu mi loko e woɔ yiblii ɔ. Ke i gbo we ɔ, i be yiblii woe. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Nɔ nɛ dii e wami se ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, e maa laa lɛ, se nɔ nɛ di we se ɔ, e ma na neneene wami kɛ to nane mi.<verse eid="JHN 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Ke ji Hela bi ɔmɛ suɔ nɛ a pee ye kaseli ɔ, nyɛ de mɛ nɛ a ba nyɛɛ ye se, ejakaa he nɛ i ngɛ ɔ lejɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ ye sɔmɔli hu maa hi. Nɛ Tsɛ ɔ maa wo a hɛ mi nyami ke a ba nyɛɛ ye se. <verse eid="JHN 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Ye klaa ngɛ haoe saminya amlɔ nɛ ɔ. Anɛ e sa kaa ma sɔle nɛ ma de ke, ‘Tsaatsɛ, mo je mi kɛ je haomi nɛ ma ngɛ ye hɛ mi nɛ ɔ mi?’ Se kɛ ɔ, lɔ ɔ nɔuu he nɛ i ba ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tsaatsɛ, moo wo o biɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Kɛkɛ nɛ gbi ko de kɛ je hiɔwe ke, “I wo e hɛ mi nyami momo, nɛ ma wo e hɛ mi nyami ekohu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Benɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nu gbi nɛ ɔ, a ti ni komɛ de ke Mawu bɔfo nɛ e kɛ lɛ tu munyu. <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Tsa pi ye he nɛ gbi ɔ pɛ ngɛ, se nyɛ he i. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Be nɛ a kɛ maa kojo je ɔ su, nɛ a ma sake Abosiami nɛ ji je nɛ ɔ matsɛ bi ɔ ngɔ fɔ he. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nɛ ke a wo ye nɔ kɛ je zugba a nɔ ɔ, i ma gbla nɔ tsuaa nɔ kɛ ba ye ngɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu tu munyu nɛ ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ gbenɔ nɛ e ma gbo ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Asafo ɔ bi ke, “Gbenɔ he munyu nɛ o ngɛ tue ɔ? Wɔɔ lɛɛ wa le kaa Mesia a be gboe gbleegbleegblee. Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ wɔ dee ke e ma gbo ɔ? Mesia te nɔ nɛ o ngɛ tsɔɔe nɛɛ?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Be bɔɔ pɛ nɛ piɛ nɛ ye la a maa tso ha nyɛ. Be abɔ nɛ la a ngɛ tsoe nɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ nyɛɛ ngɛ la a nya kɛ ya he fɛɛ he nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae loko diblii ɔ nɛ ba wo. Ejakaa nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ngɛ diblii mi ɔ, e laa blɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Nyɛ tsu la a he ni ngɛ be nɛ ɔ mi nɛ nyɛ maa pee la bimɛ.” Benɛ Yesu gbe munyu nɛ ɔmɛ a nya a, e je lejɛ ɔ nɛ e ya laa e he.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Nɛ ngɛ nyakpɛ níhi slɔɔtohi nɛ e pee ɔ se ɔ, nihi he we lɛ yi lolo kaa lɛ ji Mesia a. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Enɛ ɔ ba mi kaa bɔ nɛ Gbalɔ Yesaia de ɔ ke, “Nutsɔ, mɛnɔ ma he wɔ maa ye? Nɛ mɛnɔ maa ngɔ Mawu nyakpɛ okadi ɔmɛ kaa anɔkuale nihi?” <verse eid="JHN 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />A he we yi, ejakaa Yesaia de ekohu ke, <verse eid="JHN 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Mawu ha nɛ a hɛ yu, nɛ e ha mɛ tɛ tsui bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko hyɛ nɔ, nɛ a ko nu nɔ́ hulɔ, nɛ a ko ba ye ngɔ nɛ ma tsa mɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Yesu he nɛ Yesaia tu munyu nɛ ɔ ngɛ, ejakaa a je Mesia a anunyami kpo kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ ngɛ ni nami mi.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ a ti nihi fuu he Yesu nɔ ye kaa lɛ ji Mesia a, se a je we a he si, ejakaa a ngɛ gbeye yee kaa Farisi bi ɔmɛ maa fie mɛ kɛ je kpe he ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Nɛ a suɔ nɛ a sa nimli a hɛ mi pe Mawu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Se Yesu de asafo ɔ kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Nɔ nɛ heɔ mi yeɔ ɔ, pi ami nɛ e heɔ yeɔ, se Mawu i. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Ejakaa nɔ nɛ na mi ɔ, Mawu, nɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ nɛ e ngɛ hyɛe ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />I ba kaa La nɛ ma ba tso kɛ ha diblii je ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ ye nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e ko nyɛɛ ngɛ diblii mi hu . <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Nɛ ke nɔ ko nu ye munyu ɔ se e bui tue ɔ, tsa pi ami nɛ ma kojo lɛ ejakaa i bɛ ngɛ je ɔ kojomi he, se mohu e yi wami hemi he nɛ i ba ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Se nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ kua mi kɛ ye munyu ɔ, a maa kojo lɛ ngɛ nyagbe Kojomi Ligbi ɔ nɔ ngɛ anɔkuale munyuhi nɛ i tu ɔ he. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ejakaa pi ami nitsɛ ye juɛmi nya níhi, se i de nyɛ níhi nɛ Tsɛ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ ke ma ba de nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Nɛ i le kaa e munyu ɔmɛ kpakaa nɔ kɛ yaa neneene wami mi; nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e kɛ wo ye nya ke ma de ɔ, i deɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu fɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ a nane he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Yesu na le jamɛ a ligbi gbɔkuɛ ɔ nɛ a maa je Hebemi yemi ɔ sisi ɔ kaa e nyagbe ligbi ngɛ zugba a nɔ ɔ su, nɛ e maa kpale kɛ ho e Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ ya. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ benɛ a ngɛ gbɔkuɛ ni yee ɔ, Abosiami sɛ Yuda Iskariot nɛ ji Simon bi ɔ mi momo kaa e tsɔɔ Yesu se blɔ jamɛ a gbɔkuɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu le kaa Mawu to nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ kɛ wo e dɛ; nɛ e le kaa e je Mawu ngɔ nɛ e maa kpale kɛ ho Mawu ngɔ ya. Nɛ e suɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ saminya. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e te si ngɛ niye ni ɔ sisi nɛ e je e tade ɔmɛ ngɔ fɔ si, nɛ e ngɔ papahu kɛ muɔ e mlɛ mi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />E po nyu kɛ wo goga mi nɛ e kɛ fɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ a nanehi a he, nɛ e ngɔ papahu ɔ kɛ tsu a he. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Benɛ e su Simon Petro nɔ ɔ, Petro de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, e sɛ kaa o fɔɔ wa nanehi a he.” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “O li nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ pee amlɔ nɛ ɔ, se ke pee se ɔ o maa le.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petro he nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Dabi! Mo ko fɔ ye nane he kɔkɔɔkɔ.” Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Ke i fɔ we o nane he ɔ, o be blɔ nya ko ngɛ ye ngɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Jehanɛ ɔ Petro hia ngmlaa ke, “Ke ja a, lɛɛ mo fɔ ye nine kɛ ye yi he kɛ piɛ ye nane ɔ he mɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Se Yesu de lɛ ke, “Nɔ nɛ du e he ɔ, e hia we e he fɔmi hu, ja e nane he kɛkɛ, konɛ e he nɛ je kɛ pi si. Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ he je momo, se pi nyɛ tsuo.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu de enɛ ɔ, ejakaa e le nɔ nɛ maa tsɔɔ e se blɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ e de ke, “Tsa pi nyɛ kulaa nɛ nyɛ he je ɔ nɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Benɛ Yesu gbe a nanehi a he fɔmi ɔ nya a, e wo e tade ɔmɛ ekohu nɛ e ho hi si nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Anɛ nyɛ nu nɔ́ nɛ i pee ha nyɛ nɛ ɔ sisi lo? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Nyɛ tsɛɔ mi ke, ‘Nutsɔ’, kɛ ‘Tsɔɔlɔ’, nɛ e ji anɔkuale. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Nɛ si abɔ nɛ ami, Nutsɔ kɛ Tsɔɔlɔ ɔ fɔ nyɛ nanehi a he ɔ, e sa kaa nyɛ hu nyɛ fɔ nyɛ si bi a nane he ha mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Enɛ ɔ ji okadi ko nɛ i to nyɛ konɛ nyɛ hu nyɛɛ pee ja a nɔuu. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke sɔmɔlɔ pa we e nutsɔ, nɛ tsɔlɔ hu pa we nɔ nɛ tsɔ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Ke nyɛ le ní nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛ ye nɔ ɔ, a maa jɔɔ nyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Tsa pi nyɛ tsuo nɛ i ngɛ ní nɛ ɔmɛ dee, ejakaa i le nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ i hla a; se mohu bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ́ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ke, ‘Nɔ nɛ kɛ mi ngɛ ni yee ɔ ji nɔ nɛ maa tsɔɔ ye se blɔ’ ɔ nɛ ba mi. Nɛ e be kɛe nɛ enɛ ɔ maa ba mi. <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />I ngɛ nyɛ enɛ ɔmɛ dee konɛ ke a ba mi ɔ, nɛ nyɛ he ye nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye.<verse eid="JHN 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Anɔkuale munyu nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ tue ke, nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma he ye tsɔlɔ ɔ atuu ɔ, ami nɛ e ngɛ hee ɔ nɛ. Nɛ nɔ nɛ ma he mi atuu ɔ, ye Tsɛ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ nɛ e ngɛ hee ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ ti nɔ kake maa tsɔɔ ye se blɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Benɛ Yesu gbe munyu nɛ ɔmɛ a nya a, e bɔni haomi ngɛ mumi mi wawɛɛ nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Niinɛ, nyɛ ti nɔ kake maa tsɔɔ ye se blɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ bɔni a bi a hɛ mi hyɛmi kaa a maa na a ti nɔ nɛ he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue ɔ lo. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Kaseli ɔmɛ a ti no kake nɛ Yesu suɔ saminya a hii si ngɛ e kasa mi tutuutu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Simon Petro ma lɛ hɛ ngmɛ kaa e bi lɛ a ti nɔ nɛ he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Nɛ kaselɔ nɛ ɔ plɛ e he nɛ e bi Yesu ke, “Nutsɔ, mɛnɔ i?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu he nɔ ke, “Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ i ma ngɔ hɛ mi nyami womi abolo ɔ kɛ tsɔ nɔ́ ɔ mi ngɔ ha a nɛ.” Nɛ benɛ e kɛ tsɔ mi ɔ, e ngɔ ha Yuda nɛ ji Simon Iskariot bi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda ye ni ɔ ta pɛ nɛ Abosiami sɛ e mi kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Moo pee nɔ́ nɛ o ngɛ pee ɔ mla.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Se ni kpa amɛ nɛ ngɛ okplɔɔ ɔ he ɔ, a ti nɔ ko li nɔ́ nɛ Yesu ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />A ti ni komɛ susu kaa e ngɛ Yuda Iskariot nɛ ji a sika tolɔ ɔ tsɔe nɛ e ya wo niye ni ɔ hiɔ aloo nɛ e ya ke ohiafo ɔmɛ sika. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ Yuda je kpo kɛ sɛ diblii ɔ mi. <verse eid="JHN 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda je tsu ɔ mi pɛ nɛ Yesu de ke, “Ye be ɔ su. E piɛ bɔɔ nɛ Mawu anunyami ɔ maa bɔle mi nɛ a ma je Mawu yi ngɛ níhi nɛ maa ba ye nɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Nɛ e be kɛe nɛ Mawu kɛ e anunyami ɔ ma ha mi. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Bimɛ nɛ i suɔ, be nɛ ɔmɛ a se be kɛe loko i ma si nyɛ. Nyɛ ma hla mi mohu, se kaa bɔ nɛ i de Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ ɔ, he nɛ i yaa a, nyɛ be lejɛ ɔ nyɛe maa ba.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ kita he woe kaa nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he kaa bɔ nɛ i suɔ nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ejakaa ke nyɛ suɔ nyɛ he saminya a, nɛ je ɔ maa na kaa ye kaseli ji nyɛ niinɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simon Petro bi Yesu ke, “Nutsɔ, jije nɛ o yaa?” Yesu he nɔ de lɛ ke, “He nɛ i yaa a o be nyɛe nɛ o kɛ mi maa ya amlɔ nɛ ɔ, se o maa ba hwɔɔ se ko.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Nɛ Petro bi lɛ ekohu ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ i be nyɛe yami amlɔ nɛ ɔ? Ejakaa i dla ye he nɛ ma gbo ngɛ o he.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu bi lɛ ke, “O ma gbo ngɛ ye he lo? Dabi! I ngɛ mo dee ke hwɔɔ ɔ, kungwɔ be nɔ́ kpae nɛ o ma kua si etɛ ke o li mi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Nyɛ ko ye tsui, nyɛ heɔ Mawu nɔ yeɔ, nyɛ he ami hu ye nɔ nyɛɛ ye. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Sihi hehi babauu ngɛ ye Tsɛ we ɔ, ke pi ja a jinɛ i de nyɛ momo; nɛ i yaa nɛ ma ya dla mɛ ngɔ to nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Nɛ ke i ya dla mɛ ta a, i ma kpale kɛ ba ekohu nɛ ma ba wo nyɛ kɛ ya hi he nɛ i ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Nyɛ le he nɛ i yaa a, nɛ nyɛ le blɔ ɔ hulɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Toma de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, wa li he nɛ o yaa a, kɛ wa maa pee kɛ le blɔ ɔ kɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “Ami ji Blɔ ɔ kɛ Anɔkuale ɔ kɛ Wami ɔ nɛ. Nɔ ko be Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ nyɛe maa ba, ja e gu ye nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ke nyɛ le mi jinɛ nyɛ ko le ye Tsɛ ɔ hulɔ. Kɛ je mwɔnɛ ɔ kɛ yaa nɛ ɔ, nyɛ le lɛ ejakaa nyɛ na lɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo de Yesu ke, “Mawetsɛ, moo tsɔɔ wɔ Tsɛ ɔ, nɛ e maa hi ha wɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu ha lɛ heto ke, “Filipo! Lɛɛ kɛ je be nɛ i kɛ mo hi si kɛ ya si nɛ ɔ, o li mi lolo lo? Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ na mi ɔ, e na Tsɛ ɔ. Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ mi bie ke ma tsɔɔ mo Tsɛ ɔ mɔ? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />O he we yi kaa i ngɛ Tsɛ ɔ mi nɛ Tsɛ ɔ hu ngɛ ye mi lo? Tsa pi ami nitsɛ ye he wami nya munyuhi nɛ i tuɔ nyɛ ɔ, se Tsɛ ɔ nɛ ngɛ ye mi ɔ, e munyuhi i. E tsuɔ e ni tsumi ɔ kɛ guu ye nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ye kɛkɛ kaa i ngɛ Tsɛ ɔ mi nɛ Tsɛ ɔ hu ngɛ ye mi. Aloo nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ye ngɛ nyakpɛ ni tsumi agbohi nɛ i tsu ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee ngɛ anɔkuale klɔuu mi kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ mi yeɔ ɔ, e ma tsu nyakpɛ ni tsumihi nɛ i tsu ɔmɛ, nɛ tete po ɔ, e maa pee nyakpɛ nihi nɛ kle pe ja, ejakaa i yaa Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Nɛ i ma pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nyɛ ma bi lɛ ngɛ ye biɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ, ejakaa e maa pee yi jemi kɛ ha Tsɛ ɔ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ e Bi ɔ tsu ɔ he je. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Nyɛ bi nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ ye biɛ mi nɛ i ma pee ha nyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ he si womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Ke nyɛ suɔ mi ɔ, nyɛɛ ye ye gbi nɔ; <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />nɛ i ma bi Tsɛ ɔ nɛ e ma ha nyɛ Hepiɛlɔ kpa, nɛ e kɛ nyɛ ma ba hi si kɛ ya neneene. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Lɛ ji Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ, mumi nɛ kɛ nɔ yaa anɔkuale mi ɔ. Je ɔ kulaa be lɛ hee atuu ejakaa e hla we lɛ, nɛ e li lɛ. Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ le lɛ, ejakaa e ngɛ nyɛ ngɔ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nɛ e maa hi nyɛ mi ligbi ko. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />I be nyɛ sie awusahi gblee ngɛ haomi mi, i ma ba nyɛ ngɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />E piɛ bɔɔ nɛ i ma si je ɔ mi, se loloolo ɔ i kɛ nyɛ maa hi si. Ejakaa i ma ba wami mi ekohu kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Ke i kpale kɛ ba wami mi ekohu ɔ, nyɛ maa na kaa i ngɛ Tsɛ ɔ mi, nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ ngɛ ye mi, nɛ ami hu i ngɛ nyɛ mi. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Nɔ nɛ yeɔ ye gbi nɔ ɔ, lɛ ji nɔ nɛ suɔ mi. Nɛ akɛnɛ e suɔ mi ɔ, ye Tsɛ hu maa suɔ lɛ. Ami hu ma suɔ lɛ, nɛ ma je ye he si kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Se Yesu kaselɔ kpa ko nɛ a tsɛɛ le ke Yuda, tsa pi Yuda Iskariot, bi lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, mɛni he je nɛ o ma je o he si kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ o kaseli ɔmɛ kɛkɛ, se pi je ɔ tsuo ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu ha lɛ heto ke, “I ma je ye he si kɛ tsɔɔ nihi nɛ suɔ mi nɛ a yeɔ ye gbi nɔ ɔ kɛkɛ. Ye Tsɛ hu maa suɔ mɛ, nɛ wa maa ba a ngɔ, nɛ waa kɛ mɛ maa hi si. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Nɔ nɛ yi ye munyu ɔ nɔ ɔ, e sume mi. Tsa pi ami nɛ i ngɛ munyu ɔ heto hae ɔ se mohu Tsɛ ɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ i. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />I ngɛ munyu nɛ ɔmɛ tue amlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Se ke Tsɛ ɔ tsɔ Hepiɛlɔ nɛ ji Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, e maa tsɔɔ nyɛ níhi fuu, nɛ e ma kai nyɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ i de nyɛ ɔ hulɔ.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />I ngɛ he jɔmi sie ha nyɛ. Tsa pi je ɔ he jɔmi nɛ e haa a nɛ i ngɛ sie ha nyɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko ye tsui, nɛ nyɛ ko ye gbeye. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Nyɛ kai kaa i de nyɛ ke i yaa, se i ma kpale kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ ekohu. Ke nyɛ suɔ mi niinɛ ɔ, nyɛ bua maa jɔ kaa i yaa Tsɛ nɛ kle pe mi ɔ ngɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />I de nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ fɔ si bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ke a ba mi ɔ nɛ nyɛ he nyɛɛ ye.<verse eid="JHN 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />I be be nɛ i kɛ nyɛ maa tu munyu fuu, ejakaa je ɔ mi matsɛ bi ɔ su si ta. E be ye nɔ he wami; <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />se i ma pee bɔ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ suɔ, konɛ je ɔ nɛ na le kaa i suɔ Tsɛ ɔ. Nyɛɛ te si nɛ waa ho.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ji Wai Tso kpakpa a nɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Ami ji anɔkuale Wai Tso ɔ nɛ, nɛ ye Tsɛ ji Abɔɔtsɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />E poo wai tso ɔmɛ a kɔnihi nɛ wui yiblii ɔ. Nɛ e kplɔɔ kɔnihi nɛ woɔ yiblii ɔmɛ tete a he bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a wo yiblii agbohi pe kekle ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />E kplɔ nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ he je momo ngɛ munyuhi nɛ i tu nyɛ ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Nyɛɛ hi ye mi nɛ ami hu ma hi nyɛ mi. Kaa bɔ nɛ wai tso kɔni wui yiblii ke a kplɔ lɛ kɛ je wai tso ɔ he ɔ, ja a nɔuu nɛ e maa ba mi ha nyɛ ke nyɛ tsɔ nyɛ he kɛ je ye he.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Ami ji Wai Tso ɔ, nɛ nyɛ ji kɔni ɔmɛ. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hii ye mi nɛ ami hu i hii e mi ɔ, e woɔ yiblii fuu. Ejakaa nyɛ be nɔ́ ko nyɛe maa pee ke i piɛ we nyɛ he. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Nɔ nɛ be ye mi ɔ, a sakee lɛ kɛ fɔɔ he kaa tso kɔni nɛ he be se nami, nɛ e gbliɔ nɛ a buaa nya nɛ a tsɔɔ lɛ la kɛ ekpahi. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Se ke nyɛ ngɛ ye mi nɛ nyɛ ye ye kita amɛ a nɔ ɔ, nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nyɛ ma kpa he pɛɛ ɔ, a maa pee ha nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Nihi nɛ a ji ye anɔkuale kaseli ɔmɛ woɔ yiblii fuu. Nɛ enɛ ɔ haa ye Tsɛ hɛ mi baa nyami babauu.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />I suɔ nyɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ suɔ mi ɔ; jaa he ɔ, nyɛɛ hi si ngɛ ye suɔmi ɔ mi. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ke nyɛ ye ye kita amɛ a nɔ ɔ, nyɛ maa hi ye suɔmi ɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ ami hu i ye ye Tsɛ kita amɛ a nɔ nɛ i ngɛ e suɔmi ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />I ngɛ nyɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ dee bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ na bua jɔmi babauu. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />I ngɛ nyɛ kita woe kaa nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he kaa bɔ nɛ i suɔ nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Suɔmi nɛ kle pe kulaa ji kaa nɔ ko maa ngɔ e wami kɛ sa afɔle ngɛ e huɛmɛ a he; <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />nɛ nyɛ peeɔ ye huɛmɛ ke nyɛ ye ye kita amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />I tsɛ we nyɛ ke nyɔguɛhi hu, ejakaa nyɔguɛhi li nɔ́ nɛ a nutsɔ peeɔ; amlɔ nɛ ɔ ye huɛhi ji nyɛ, ejakaa i de nyɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ye Tsɛ ɔ de mi ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Tsa pi nyɛ nɛ nyɛ hla mi, se ami nɛ i hla nyɛ, nɛ i tsɔ nyɛ konɛ nyɛ ya wo yiblii kpakpahi daa, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Tsɛ ɔ nɛ ha nyɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nyɛ ma bi lɛ ngɛ ye biɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee ke nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he, <verse eid="JHN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />ejakaa je ɔ maa nyɛ nyɛ. Se nyɛ kai kaa je ɔ nyɛ mi loko ji e ba su nyɛ nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Je ɔ mi bimɛ ji nyɛ jinɛ je ɔ maa suɔ nyɛ sane. Se nyɛ pi je ɔ mi bimɛ, ejakaa i hla nyɛ kɛ je je ɔ mi. Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ je ɔ sume nyɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Nyɛ he nɛ ko je nɔ́ nɛ i de nyɛ ɔ nɔ kaa, ‘Nyɔguɛ pa we e nutsɔ ɔ.’ Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke a pee mi níhi nɛ sɛ ɔ, a maa pee nyɛ hu ja a nɔuu. Nɛ kaa a bu mi tue jinɛ a maa bu nyɛ hu tue. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Je ɔ mi bi ɔmɛ maa wa nyɛ yi mi ngɛ ye nihi nɛ nyɛ ji ɔ he je, ejakaa a li Mawu nɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Nɛ kaa i bɛ nɛ ma ba tu munyu kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ jinɛ a be mɛ fɔ bue, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a be nya jemi ko ngɛ a yayami ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ mi ɔ, e ngɛ ye Tsɛ hu nyɛe. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Kaa i tsu we nyakpɛ ni tsumi nguahi ngɛ a kpɛti nɛ a na jinɛ a be mɛ fɔ bue. Se a na ni tsumi nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ loloolo ɔ, a sume i kɛ ye Tsɛ ɔ tsuo. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Nɛ enɛ ɔ ha nɛ nɔ́ nɛ gbali ɔmɛ de ngɛ Mesia a he ke, ‘A nyɛ mi gu ɔ’ ba mi.<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Se i ma tsɔ Hepiɛlɔ nɛ ji Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ mane nyɛ. Lɛ ji anɔkuale Mumi ɔ nɛ maa je Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ, nɛ lɛ e ma ba ye ye he odase. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ maa ye ye he odase, ejakaa nyɛɛ kɛ mi hi si kɛ je sisije.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Haomi kɛ bua jɔmi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“I de nyɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ nane ko tɔtɔ ngɛ níhi nɛ maa ba a he. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Ejakaa a maa fie nyɛ kɛ maa je kpe he ɔmɛ, nɛ be ma nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ nyɛ gbee ɔ ma susu kaa Mawu suɔmi nya ni nɛ a ngɛ tsue. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />A maa pee nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ, ejakaa a li Tsɛ ɔ loo ami <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />I ngɛ nyɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ dee konɛ ke be ɔ su ɔ, nyɛ kai kaa i wo a nɔ ta de nyɛ. I de we nyɛ kɛ ji sisije ɔ mi, ejakaa i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Se jehanɛ ɔ, i kpale kɛ yaa nɔ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ ngɔ, nɛ e pee we nyɛ ti nɔ ko kɔmɔ nɛ e ma bi nɔ́ nɛ he je nɛ i yaa a; <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />se mohu kɔmɔ kɛkɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ yee. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Se i ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, ke i ho ɔ e hi ha nyɛ, ejakaa jaja loko Hepiɛlɔ ɔ maa ba nyɛ ngɔ.<verse eid="JHN 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Nɛ ke e ba a, e ma ka je ɔ hɛ mi ngɛ yayami he, nɛ e maa tsɔɔ dami kɛ kojomi. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Je ɔ pee yayami, ejakaa nimli ɔmɛ he we ye nɔ yi; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />se dami maa hi si ejakaa i yaa Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ, nɛ a be mi nae hu; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />nɛ a ma kpɔ nyɛ kɛ je kojomi mi ejakaa a kojo je ɔ matsɛ bi ɔ momo.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />I ngɛ níhi fuu nɛ ma suɔ ma de nyɛ, se nyɛ be a sisi nue amlɔ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Se ke Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ji anɔkuale ɔ ba a, e ma ba tsɔɔ nyɛ anɔkuale ɔ kulaa mi blɔ, ejakaa tsa pi lɛ nitsɛ e juɛmi mi níhi nɛ e ma ba de nyɛ, se mohu nihi nɛ a ma de lɛ ke e de ɔ. Nɛ e maa tsi nihi nɛ maa ba a nɔ ta kɛ de nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />E ma je ye yi nɛ e maa wo ye hɛ mi nyami, ejakaa e maa tsɔɔ nyɛ ye anunyami ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Tsɛ anunyami ɔ kulaa a, ye nɔ i, nɛ nɔ nɛ i de ke e maa tsɔɔ nyɛ ye anunyami ɔ, e sisi ji lɔ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />E piɛ bɔɔ nɛ ma si nyɛ, nɛ nyɛ be mi nae hu, nɛ lɔ ɔ se bɔɔ ɔ, nyɛ maa na mi ekohu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17-18" />Nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ bi a he ke, “Se mɛni kulaa e ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa ‘I yaa Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ’ ɔ? Wa nui ní nɛ e ngɛ dee ɔ sisi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu kɔ se kaa a ngɛ hlae nɛ a bi lɛ, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e de mɛ ke, “Akɛnɛ i de nyɛ ke e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ ma si nyɛ nɛ nyɛ be mi nae hu, nɛ e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ nyɛ maa na mi ekohu ɔ, enɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ he bie ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, je ɔ ma nya ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ maa ba ye nɔ ɔ he, se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ ma fo ya nɛ nyɛ maa ye kɔmɔ, se nyɛ kɔmɔ yemi ɔ ma plɛ bua jɔmi, be mi nɛ nyɛ maa na mi ekohu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Nyɛ bua jɔmi ɔ maa pee kaa bɔ nɛ yo nuu kɔɔmi nɛ e fɔɔ. E nɔ́ nami kɛ pimi ɔ ba plɛɔ bua jɔmi haa lɛ si kake too, nɛ e hɛ jee e haomi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ maa ye kɔmɔ, se i ma kpale kɛ ba ekohu nɛ nyɛ bua maa jɔ nyɛ he, nɛ nɔ ko be nyɛ bua jɔmi ɔ kpɔe ngɛ nyɛ dɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, nyɛ be mi nɔ ko bie hu, ejakaa Tsɛ ɔ ma ha nyɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nyɛ ma kpa he pɛɛ ngɛ ye biɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Nyɛ pee we ja a hyɛ; nyɛ bi nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ ye biɛ mi, nɛ nyɛ ma na konɛ nyɛ bua jɔmi ɔ nɛ hyi fuu.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />I de nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ abɛhi a mi, se be ma nɛ i kɛ nyɛ be munyu tue ngɛ abɛ mi hu, se mohu ma jaje Tsɛ ɔ he sane ma tsɔɔ nyɛ paa. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Ke jamɛ a be ɔ su ɔ, nyɛ ma bi nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ ye biɛ mi, nɛ e hia we kaa ma bi Tsɛ ɔ loko e ha nyɛ nyɛ hiami ni ɔmɛ, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />ejakaa Tsɛ ɔ suɔ nyɛ saminya, akɛnɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ suɔ mi, nɛ nyɛ he ye kaa Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ nɛ i je ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Niinɛ, Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ nɛ i je kɛ ba je ɔ mi, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ hu i ma kpale kɛ ho Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ ya.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />E kaseli ɔmɛ de lɛ ke, “Kpaloko o ngɛ munyu tue paa, nɛ o tui munyu ngɛ abɛ mi hu. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Jehanɛ ɔ, wa na kaa o le nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e hia we kaa nɔ ko nɛ de mo nɔ ko. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, wa he ye kaa Mawu ngɔ nɛ o je.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu he nɔ nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Anɛ nyɛ heɔ yeɔ jehanɛ ɔ lo? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Nyɛ nɛ, ngmlɛfia a ma, nɛ e su ta, nɛ nyɛ maa gbɛ fia, nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ma pue e we mi blɔ, nɛ nyɛ maa je ami nɔ kake ye he. Se kɛ ɔ, tsa pi ami nɔ kake i, ejakaa Tsɛ ɔ kɛ mi ngɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />I de nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo konɛ nyɛɛ wo nyɛ he bua. Nyɛ ma na haomi kɛ pimi ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi, se nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ nyɛ he, ejakaa i ye je ɔ nɔ kunimi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu sɔle kɛ ha e kaseli ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Benɛ Yesu tu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ se ɔ, e hyɛ hiɔwe nɛ e de ke, “Tsaatsɛ, be ɔ su. Moo wo o Bi ɔ hɛ mi nyami konɛ lɛ hu e wo o hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ejakaa o ha lɛ he wami ngɛ adesa fɛɛ adesa nɔ ngɛ zugba a nɔ, konɛ e ha a ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ o ngɔ ha lɛ ɔ neneene wami. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Nɛ neneene wami nɛ a ma na ji kaa a le mo nɔ nɛ ji anɔkuale Mawu kake too ɔ, kɛ Yesu Kristo nɔ nɛ o tsɔ kɛ ba zugba a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />I wo o hɛ mi nyami ngɛ zugba a nɔ, ejakaa i gbe ni tsumi nɛ o ha mi ɔ nya. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Tsaatsɛ, mo je anunyami nɛ i kɛ mo ngɛ loko je ɔ bɔ ade ɔ kpo kɛ wo ye hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />I de nimli ɔmɛ nɛ o ngɔ ha mi ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi ɔ o he nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ. O nihi ji mɛ, nɛ o ngɔ mɛ kɛ ha mi nɛ a bu mo tue. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a le kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ i ngɛ ɔ, mo o nike ni i. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />I tsɔɔ mɛ kitahi nɛ o ngɔ ha mi ɔmɛ, nɛ a he mɛ atuu, nɛ a na le paa kaa o ngɔ nɛ i je kɛ ba zugba a nɔ, nɛ a he ye kaa mo nɛ o tsɔ mi.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Tsa pi je ɔ nɛ i ngɛ pɛɛ kpae ha, se mohu kɛ ha nihi nɛ o kɛ ha mi ɔ, ejakaa o nihi ji mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Akɛnɛ ye nihi ji mɛ tsuo ɔ, a peeɔ o nihi hulɔ. Nɛ o ngɔ mɛ kɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ o ngɛ ɔ kɛ ha mi konɛ a pee ye hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, i ngɛ je ɔ mi sie, nɛ i ngɛ mɛ hu sie kɛ ma o ngɔ. Tsaatsɛ Klɔuklɔu, i ngɛ nihi nɛ o ngɔ ha mi ɔmɛ toe kɛ ngɛ o dɛ woe. A pee kake kaa bɔ nɛ wɔ hu wa ngɛ kake ɔ, nɛ a ti nɔ ko nɛ ko laa. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Benɛ i kɛ nihi nɛ o ngɔ ha mi ɔ hi si ngɛ je ɔ mi ɔ, i bu a he nɛ a ti nɔ ko laa we, ja hɛ mi kpatami bi ɔ pɛ, konɛ nɔ́ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ɔ nɛ ba mi.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i ma o ngɔ, nɛ i de mɛ níhi fuu be mi nɛ i kɛ mɛ ngɛ ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na bua jɔmi. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />I ha mɛ o mlaa amɛ nɛ je ɔ ngɛ mɛ nyɛe, ejakaa tsa pi je ɔ mi nɛ a je, kaa bɔ nɛ ami hu i ji je ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />I bi we ke o je mɛ kɛ je je ɔ mi, se mohu o bu a he, nɛ o je mɛ kɛ je Abosiami dɛ mi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />A pi je ɔ mi bimɛ hu, kaa bɔ nɛ ami hu i pi je ɔ mi no ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Moo tsɔɔ mɛ o anɔkuale munyu ɔ nɛ e ha nɛ a he nɛ tsɔ nɛ a pee klɔuklɔu bimɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />I ngɛ mɛ tsɔe kɛ yaa je ɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ o tsɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />I to ye he klɔuklɔu bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma tsu a he ni nɛ a wa ngɛ anɔkuale kɛ he tsɔmi mi.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Tsa pi mɛ kɛkɛ nɛ i ngɛ sɔlee ngɛ pɛɛ kpae ha, se mohu kɛ ha nihi hu nɛ hwɔɔ se ɔ, a ma he ye munyu ɔ maa ye kɛ gu a odase yemi nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Ye sɔlemi ji, mɛ tsuo a pee kake ngɛ tsui kɛ juɛmi mi kaa bɔ nɛ mo, Tsaatsɛ, o kɛ mi ngɛ ɔ, nɛ o ngɛ ye mi nɛ ami hu i ngɛ o mi ɔ, konɛ mɛ hu a hi wa mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ je ɔ nɛ he ye kaa mo nɛ o tsɔ mi.<verse eid="JHN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />I ha mɛ anunyami nɛ o ngɔ ha mi ɔ, konɛ a pee kake kaa bɔ nɛ wɔ hu wa ngɛ kake ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />I ngɛ a mi, nɛ mo hu o ngɛ ye mi, nɛ wɔ tsuo wa pee kake kɛ pi si, konɛ je ɔ nɛ na kaa mo nɛ o tsɔ mi, nɛ o suɔ mɛ kaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Tsaatsɛ, i suɔ nɛ nihi nɛ o ngɔ ha mi ɔ, a hi ye ngɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na ye anunyami nɛ o ngɔ ha mi ɔ, ejakaa o suɔ mi loko je ɔ bɔ ade.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Oo Tsaatsɛ dalɔ, je ɔ li mo se ami lɛɛ i le mo nɛ kaseli nɛ ɔmɛ hu le kaa mo nɛ o tsɔ mi; <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />nɛ i je o he si ngɔ tsɔɔ mɛ, nɛ i ma hi o he si jee kɛ hi mɛ tsɔɔe bɔ nɛ pee nɛ suɔmi nɛ o ngɛ kɛ ha mi ɔ, e hi mɛ hu a mi, nɛ ami hu ma hi a mi.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">A nu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Benɛ Yesu tu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ gbe nya a, e je lejɛ ɔ nɛ e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ya po Kedron Pa a kɛ ho abɔɔ ko mi ya. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, nɔ nɛ tsɔɔ e se blɔ ɔ le lejɛ ɔ, ejakaa Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ pɔɔ lejɛ ɔ yami.<verse eid="JHN 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ tsɔ sojahi kɛ polisihi kɛ piɛ Yuda he, nɛ a hɛɛ kanehi ke awi yemi nihi kɛ ba abɔɔ ɔ mi.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Akɛnɛ Yesu le nɔ́ nɛ maa ba e nɔ he je ɔ, e je kpo nɛ e kɛ mɛ ya kpe, nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛnɔ nyɛ ngɛ hlae?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Tsɔli ɔmɛ he nɔ ke, “Wa ngɛ Yesu Nazaret no ɔ hlae?” Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Ami ji nɛ ɔ nɛ!” <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Se Yesu nya nɔɛ si nɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ tsuo gbee senyasenya ya nɔ si.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Nɛ e bi mɛ ekohu ke, “Mɛnɔ nyɛ ngɛ hlae?” Nɛ a kpale ha lɛ heto ke, “Yesu Nazaret no ɔ nɛ wa ngɛ hlae.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “I de nyɛ ke ami ji nɛ ɔ nɛ! Nɛ ke ami nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ ha ni nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a ya.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />E ha mɛ heto nɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ́ nɛ gbalɔ ɔ de ke, “I laa we nihi nɛ o ngɔ ha mi ɔ a ti nɔ ko” ɔ nɛ ba mi.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Simon Petro hia klaate nɛ e po Malko nɛ ji Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a tsɔlɔ ɔ hiɔ tue.<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Se Yesu de Petro ke, “Ngɔɔ klaate ɔ ngɔ hɔ e kpo ɔ mi. Anɛ e sɛ kaa ma nu kplu nɛ Tsaatsɛ ha mi ɔ e mi nyu ɔ lo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Kɛkɛ nɛ polisi ɔmɛ kɛ soja amɛ kɛ a nɔkɔtɔma a nu Yesu nɛ a fi lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Nɛ a kpaka lɛ kɛ ho Hana nɛ ji Kaiafa ngatsɛ ɔ ngɔ ya kekle, ejakaa lɛ ji Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma ngɛ jamɛ a jeha a mi. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kaiafa ji nɔ nɛ wo Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ ga kaa e sa kaa nɔ kake nɛ gbo ngɛ ma a nane mi ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simon Petro kɛ kaselɔ kake nɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a le lɛ ɔ nyɛɛ Yesu se. Akɛnɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a le kaselɔ nɛ ɔ he je ɔ, a ha lɛ blɔ nɛ e nyɛɛ Yesu se kɛ sɛ we ɔ mi. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Se Petro lɛɛ e daa si ngɛ agbo ɔ se. Kɛkɛ nɛ jamɛ a kaselɔ ɔ kpa yoyo ɔ nɛ ngɛ agbo ɔ nya bue ɔ pɛɛ nɛ e ha Petro blɔ nɛ lɛ hu e sɛ we ɔ mi. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Se yoyo o bi Petro ke, “Anɛ tsa pi Yesu kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ji mo lo?” Nɛ Petro he nɔ ke, “Dabi, tsa pi a ti nɔ eko ji mi!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ fiɛ ngɛ yee. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, polisi ɔmɛ kɛ sɔmɔli nɛ ngɛ we ɔ mi ɔ ngɛ la hluie ngɛ kpo ɔ nɔ, nɛ Petro hu ya piɛ a he.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a bi Yesu e kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ ni nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ ɔ he munyu.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu ha heto ke, “Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ le ye ni tsɔɔmi ɔmɛ, ejakaa i fiɛɔ ngɛ kpe he ɔ kɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ be fɛɛ be, nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ tsuo nuɔ ye ni tsɔɔmi ɔ, ejakaa i de we nɔ́ ko ngɛ laami mi. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ mi kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ bie? Nihi nɛ buɔ mi tue ɔ, a ti ni komɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. Bi mɛ nɛ a de mo nɔ́ nɛ i deɔ mɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Kɛkɛ nɛ soja amɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ gba Yesu ma nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Kikɛ ɔ nɛ e sa kaa o ha Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a munyu ɔ heto lo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Se Yesu de lɛ ke, “Ke i ye lakpa a, moo ye lɔ ɔ he odase, se ke anɔkuale munyu nɛ i tu ɔ, lɛɛ mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ mi ma gbae.”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Hana ha nɛ a kpaka Yesu ngɛ kpa a mi kɛ ya ha Kaiafa nɛ ji Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ Simon Petro daa si ngɛ he nɛ a slɛ la a ngɛ ɔ nɛ nɔ ko bi lɛ ekohu ke, “Anɛ tsa pi e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ji mo lo?” Se Petro kua ekohu nɛ e de ke, “Dabi, i li lɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a nyɔguɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ ji nɔ nɛ Petro po e tue ɔ weku no bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ tsa pi mo nɛ i na kɛ Yesu ngɛ abɔɔ ɔ mi ɔ lo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Se Petro kua ekohu nɛ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ kungwɔ kpa nɔ́.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ngɛ Pilato hɛ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Jehanɛ ɔ a kpaka Yesu kɛ je Kaiafa kojomi he ɔ mɔtu kpla kɛ ho Roma amlaalo nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Pilato ɔ ngɔ ya. Se Yesu nya poli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ ko sɛ we Pilato we ɔ mi, ejakaa ke a sɛ we ɔ mi ɔ a ma puɛ kɔ, nɛ a be hae nɛ a ye Hebemi to ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Pilato je kpo kɛ ba a ngɔ nɛ e ba bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni yayami nɛ Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ pee? Mɛni he nɛ nyɛ ngɛ e nya poe ngɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />A je nya nɛ a de Pilato ke, “Tsa pi yayami peelɔ ji lɛ jinɛ wa be lɛ nue kɛ ba.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Nɛ Pilato de mɛ ke, “Lɛɛ nyɛɛ ngɔ lɛ kɛ ya nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ ya kojo lɛ ngɛ nyɛ mlaa nya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Se Yuda bi ɔmɛ ha lɛ heto ke, “Wa be he blɔ nɛ wa gbee nɔ ko.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ Yesu munyu nɛ e tu kɛ fɔ si kɛ tsɔɔ gbenɔ nɛ e ma gbo ɔ ba mi.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Jehanɛ ɔ Pilato sɛ kojomi he ɔ ekohu nɛ e ha a kɛ Yesu ba e ngɔ nɛ e bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ mo ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ ɔ lo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu he nɔ nɛ e bi Pilato ke, “Mo nitsɛ o yi mi tomi munyu nɛ o ngɛ mi bie nɛ ɔ, aloo ni komɛ nɛ a de mo ngɛ ye he lo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato hu ha heto ke, “Anɛ Yuda no ji mi lo? Mo nitsɛ o ma mi bi ɔmɛ kɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ a nu mo kɛ ba ha mi. Mɛni o pee?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Jehanɛ ɔ Yesu ha lɛ heto ke, “Ye Matsɛyemi ɔ tsa pi je nɛ ɔ mi nɛ e je. Kaa ye Matsɛyemi ɔ je je nɛ ɔ mi jinɛ ye se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ maa pɛ ye he benɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ ba nu mi ɔ. Se ye Matsɛyemi ɔ ji je nɛ ɔ mi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilato bi lɛ ekohu ke, “Lɛɛ matsɛ ji mo kɛ lo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu he nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ee, lɔ ɔ he nɛ a fɔ mi ngɛ, nɛ enɛ ɔ he nɔuu i ba je ɔ mi ngɛ nɛ ma ngɔ anɔkuale ɔ kɛ ba. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ suɔ anɔkuale ɔ, peeɔ ye se nyɛɛlɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato bi Yesu ekohu ke, “Mɛni ji anɔkuale?” Kɛkɛ nɛ Pilato je kpo ekohu nɛ e ya de Yuda bi ɔmɛ ke, “I nɛ fɔ yemi sane ko ngɛ e he. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Se akɛnɛ e ji nyɛ kusumi kaa ma ngmɛɛ nihi nɛ a wo tsu mi ɔ a ti nɔ kake he kɛ ha nyɛ ngɛ Hebemi nyami ligbi ɔ nɔ he je ɔ, anɛ nyɛ maa suɔ kaa ma ngmɛɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ ɔ he kɛ ha nyɛ lo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Pilato nya mɛ si nɛ a he nɔ kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Dabi! Tsa pi nyumu nɛ ɔ, Baraba mohu.” Be mi nɛ Baraba ji ojo fialɔ.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Pilato fiaa Yesu kpa saminya. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Nɛ soja amɛ wo mio tso kɛ pee yi fimi kla, nɛ a ngɔ bu e yi nɛ a wo lɛ tade tsutsu. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Nɛ a ye e he fɛu nɛ a de ke, “Wa nga mo oo, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ.” Nɛ a gba e hɛ mi ma.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato je kpo ekohu nɛ e de Yuda bi ɔmɛ ke, “I kɛ lɛ ma nyɛ hami amlɔ nɛ ɔ, se nyɛ na nɛ nyɛɛ le paa kaa i nɛ fɔ bumi sane ko ngɛ e he.”<verse eid="JHN 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu je kpo kɛ e yi mio kla a kɛ e he tade tsutsu ɔ. Nɛ Pilato de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ nɛ Nɔmlɔ ɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Benɛ e je kpo nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ na lɛ ɔ, a kpa ngmlaa nɛ a de ke, “Moo sɛu lɛ! Moo sɛu lɛ!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ ya sɛu lɛ, ejakaa i nɛ fɔ bumi sane ko ngɛ e he.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />A ha lɛ heto ke, “Ngɛ wa mlaa nya a, e sa gbenɔ ejakaa e ngɛ e he tsɛe ke Mawu Bi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Se benɛ Pilato nu munyu nɛ ɔ e tsui po nɛ e ye gbeye pe kekle ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e ngɔ Yesu kɛ ho kojomi he ɔ ya ekohu nɛ e ya bi lɛ ke, “Jije o je?” Se Yesu pui e nya mi.<verse eid="JHN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Nɛ Pilato bi lɛ ke, “O be ye nya mi poe lo? O li kaa i ngɛ he blɔ nɛ i ngmɛɛ o he aloo i sɛuɔ mo lo?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Se Yesu de lɛ ke, “Ke pi hiɔwe nɛ o na he wami ɔ kɛ je jinɛ o be he wami ko ngɛ ye nɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ nɛ je ye he gbi ngɔ ha mo ɔ, e he yayami ɔ kle pe o nɔ́ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Pilato miɔ nɛ e maa ngmɛɛ Yesu he jamɛ a be ɔ mi. Se Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ de lɛ ke, “Ke o ngmɛɛ Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ he ɔ, lɛɛ tsa pi Kaisare huɛ ji mo. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ woɔ e he matsɛ ɔ, e te si kɛ si Kaisare.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Benɛ Pilato nu munyu nɛ ɔ, e kɛ Yesu je kpo kɛ ba a ngɔ ekohu nɛ e ho ya hi si ngɛ kojomi sɛ nɛ maa si ngɛ tɛ nɛ a fia a nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />E piɛ bɔɔ nɛ a maa fia piani ngmlɛ nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ nɛ Hebemi nyami be ɔ maa su. Nɛ Pilato de Yuda bi ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛ nɛ nyɛ matsɛ ɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />A he nɔ kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Ngɔɔ lɛ kɛ ya! Ngɔɔ lɛ kɛ ya! Moo sɛu lɛ!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni nyɛ ngɛ dee ɔ? Ma ya sɛu nyɛ matsɛ ɔ lo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Se osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ he nɔ kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Wa be matsɛ ko, ja Kaisare pɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Pilato ngmɛɛ Yesu he kɛ ha mɛ ke a ya sɛu lɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu sɛumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ a nine su Yesu nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ a ngɛ hlae ɔ. Nɛ a ngɔ e sɛumi tso ɔ kɛ tloo lɛ, nɛ a kpaka lɛ kɛ je kpo ngɛ ma a mi kɛ ho he ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Yikokonohe, nɛ Hebri gbi mi ɔ, a tsɛɛ lejɛ ɔ ke Golgata a ya. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Nɛ a ya sɛu lɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ kɛ nihi enyɔ komɛ kɛ piɛ e he, nɔ kake ngɛ e hiɔ nɔ nɛ nɔ kake hu ngɛ e muɔ nɔ, nɛ e ngɛ a kpɛti. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Nɛ Pilato ngma e he munyu kpiti ko kɛ pɛtɛ e sɛumi tso ɔ yi mi ke, “Yesu Nazaret no, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ ɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />He nɛ a sɛu Yesu ngɛ ɔ kɛ ma a mi kɛ we, nɛ akɛnɛ a ngma e he sane ɔ ngɛ Hebri kɛ Hela kɛ Roma gbi mi he je ɔ, nihi fuu kane.<verse eid="JHN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Se osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ de Pilato ke e tsake nɔ nɛ e ngma ke, “Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ” ɔ, nɛ e ngma ke, “E ke ami ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Se Pilato de mɛ ke, “Nɔ nɛ i ngma a, i ngma. E hi ja a pɛpɛɛpɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Benɛ soja amɛ sɛu Yesu se ɔ, a dla e tade ɔmɛ a mi eywiɛ kɛ ha a he nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ na eko, se e tade gaga a be tsami he. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a de ke, “Nyɛ ko ha nɛ waa dla mi, se mohu waa fɔ sɔ konɛ waa na nɔ nɛ maa ngɔ lɛ.” Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ nɔ nɛ a de ngɛ Ngmami ɔ mi ke, “A dla ye tade ɔmɛ kɛ ha a he, se ye he tade gaga a lɛɛ a fiɛ asɔ ngɛ nɔ” ɔ ba mi. <verse eid="JHN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ soja amɛ pee enɛ ɔ nɛ. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Yesu nyɛ kɛ e nyɛ ɔ nyɛmiyo kɛ Maria nɛ ji Klopa yo ɔ kɛ Maria Magdalena daa si ngɛ Yesu sɛumi tso ɔ he. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Benɛ Yesu na e nyɛ kɛ e kaselɔ ɔ nɛ e suɔ ɔ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, e de e nyɛ ɔ ke, “Maa, o binyumu ji nɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Nɛ e de e kaselɔ ɔ hu ke, “O nyɛ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ.” Nɛ kaselɔ ɔ kpaka e nyɛ ɔ kɛ ho lɛ nitsɛ e we mi ya.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Akɛnɛ Yesu le kaa a gbe nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nya he je ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Ngmami ɔ nɛ ba mi ɔ, e de ke, “Kuma ngɛ mi yee.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, wai nɛ duɔ ɔ maa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. Nɛ a ngɔ kutsa kɛ ya tsɔ mi nɛ a kɛ ma tso nya, nɛ a wo kɛ to e nya he.<verse eid="JHN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Benɛ Yesu sa e nya wai ɔ, e de ke, “A gbe nya.” Kɛkɛ nɛ e ma e yi si, nɛ e ma e nya.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ sume kaa ni gbogboehi a tlɔ sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ, akɛnɛ e ji ligbi pɔtɛɛ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ ngɛ a he dlae kɛ ha Hebemi Ligbi ɔ yemi ɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a ho ya kpa Pilato pɛɛ kaa e ha nɛ a ku a nanehi nɛ a gbo mla konɛ a je mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, soja amɛ ya ku ni enyɔ nɛ piɛ Yesu he ɔmɛ a nanehi. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Se benɛ a su Yesu nɔ ɔ, a na kaa e gbo momo, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ a kui e nanehi. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Se mohu soja amɛ a ti nɔ kake wo akplɔ kɛ gbɔ e kasa nya nɛ muɔ kɛ nyu je mi pue si amlɔ ɔ nɔuu. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Nɛ nɔ nɛ na kikɛmɛ a nɔ́ nɛ ɔ ye he odase, nɛ e odase ɔ anɔkuale i konɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ye.<verse eid="JHN 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36-37" />Soja amɛ pee ni nɛ ɔmɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ke, “A be e wu ko kue” ɔ, kɛ “A maa hyɛ nɔ nɛ a gbɔ lɛ ní” ɔ, nɛ ba mi.<verse eid="JHN 19:36-37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Pee se ɔ, Yosef nɛ je Arimatia nɛ ji Yesu kaselɔ ko nɛ je we e hɛ mi, ejakaa e ngɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ gbeye yee ɔ, ya bi Pilato ke e ngmɛɛ Yesu gbogboe ɔ he ha lɛ nɛ e ya dla. Nɛ e ha lɛ blɔ nɛ e ya je gbogboe ɔ ngɛ sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nɛ nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Nikodemo nɛ ba Yesu ngɔ nyɔ mi ko ɔ, ba piɛ Yosef he. E ngɔ gbogboe womi tsopahi nɛ ji mire kɛ aloe nɛ a futu nɛ e jiɔmi maa pee sɛni tɛ jiɔmi lafa kɛ ba nɛ a kɛ dla lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Mɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ a blaa Yesu gbogboe ɔ kɛ klala gaga nɛ a kɛ tsopa amɛ kpa mi ɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a gbogboe dlami he blɔ nya tomi ngɛ ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />He nɛ a sɛu Yesu ngɛ ɔ kɛ abɔɔ ko he kɛ we, nɛ yɔkɔ ko ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ a tui nɔ ngɛ mi hyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Nɛ akɛnɛ e sa kaa a dla lɛ mla loko Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɛ su, nɛ yɔkɔ ɔ hu ngɛ a kasa mi he je ɔ, a to lɛ ngɛ jamɛ a abɔɔ ɔ mi.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu si temi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Hɔgba mɔtu mla benɛ je mi tsɔ we lolo ɔ, Maria Magdalena ya he nɛ a to Yesu ngɛ ɔ, nɛ e na kaa a kpɛne tɛ ɔ nɛ a kɛ tsi yɔkɔ ɔ nya a kɛ ya se. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e wo fo kɛ ya bɔ Simon Petro kɛ kaselɔ ɔ nɛ Yesu suɔ ɔ amaniɛ ke, “A ba je Nutsɔ ɔ gbogboe ɔ kɛ je muɔ ɔ mi nɛ i li he nɛ a ngɔ lɛ kɛ ya to.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro kɛ kaselɔ ɔ hu sa fo kɛ ho muɔ ɔ he ya. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Benɛ a yaa a, nɔ kake ɔ sɛ Petro hlami nɛ e ya su muɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />E ba si nɛ e hyɛ muɔ ɔ mi, nɛ e na klala a nɛ a kɛ blaa gbogboe ɔ, se e sɛ we mi. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Benɛ Simon Petro ba su muɔ ɔ nya a, e sɛ mi, nɛ lɛ hu e na klala a nɛ fɔɔ si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Se nɔ́ nɛ a kɛ fi gbogboe ɔ yi ɔ lɛɛ e fɔɔ si ngɛ he ko banee. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ kaselɔ ɔ nɛ ya su muɔ ɔ nya kekle ɔ hu sɛ muɔ ɔ mi, nɛ e na, nɛ e he ye. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Se jinɛ kɛ ba si jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, a nui nɔ́ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ɔ sisi kaa e maa te si kɛ je gbeje kɛ ba wami mi ekohu ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ kpale kɛ ho we mi ya. <verse eid="JHN 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Se Maria lɛɛ e kpale kɛ ho muɔ ɔ nya ya ekohu nɛ e ya ngɛ ya foe. Nɛ benɛ e ma e yi si nɛ e hyɛ muɔ ɔ mi ekohu ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />e na Mawu bɔfohi enyɔ nɛ a wo tade futa nɛ nɔ kake hii si ngɛ yɔkɔ ɔ yi ma je, nɛ nɔ kake hu ngɛ nane si je, he nɛ Yesu gbogboe ɔ hwɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ ya foe?” Nɛ e ha mɛ heto ke, “Ejakaa a ba wo ye Nutsɔ ɔ gbogboe ɔ kɛ je nɛ i li he nɛ a wo lɛ kɛ ya to ngɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Se benɛ e plɛ e he ɔ, e na nɔ ko nɛ daa si ngɛ e se. Yesu i, se e yo we lɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni ba nɛ o ngɛ ya foe? Mɛnɔ o ngɛ hlae?” Se Maria susu kaa abɔɔ ɔ nɔ hyɛlɔ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ kɛ lɛ ngɛ munyu ɔ tue. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, ke mo nɛ o ba wo lɛ kɛ je hiɛ ɔ, lɛɛ moo tsɔɔ mi he nɛ o kɛ lɛ ya fɔ, nɛ ma ya wo lɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu tsɛ lɛ, “Maria!” Nɛ e he nɔ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Koo ta ye he, ejakaa i na we ma su Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ ngɛ hiɔwe lolo. Se mohu yaa ye nyɛmi ɔmɛ a ngɔ nɛ o ya de mɛ ke, i yaa hiɔwe ngɛ ye Tsɛ kɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ Tsɛ, ye Mawu kɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ Mawu ɔ ngɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Maria Magdalena si lejɛ ɔ nɛ e ya de kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “I na Nutsɔ ɔ!” Nɛ e de mɛ sɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ gbɔkuɛ ɔ, kaseli ɔmɛ bua a he nya ngɛ tsu ko mi nɛ a nga a yi, ejakaa a ngɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ gbeye yee. Tlukaa a, Yesu ba da si ngɛ a kpɛti nɛ e nga mɛ, <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />nɛ e wo e nine ɔmɛ kɛ e kasa a ngɔ tsɔɔ mɛ, nɛ a bua jɔ a he kaa a na Nutsɔ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ekohu ke, “I ngɛ nyɛ tsɔe kaa bɔ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ tsɔ mi ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e wo mumi ngɔ pue a nɔ, nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ he Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Ke nyɛ wo nihi a he yayami ngɔ ke mɛ ɔ, a ma ngɔ ke, se ke nyɛ ngɔɛ kɛ ki ɔ, a kɛ be kee.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Toma nguane jelɔ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Toma nɛ ji e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke “Hawi” ɔ, be lejɛ ɔ nɛ Yesu ba a. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ja a he je ɔ, benɛ kaseli nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ de lɛ ke, “Wa na Nutsɔ ɔ,” e de mɛ ke, “I he we yi, ja i na e dɛ mi plɛɛko pa amɛ a nya nɛ i slaa mɛ hyɛ nɛ i kɛ ye nine nguɛ hɔ e kasa nya he nɛ a gbɔ ɔ loko ma he ye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ligbi kpaanyɔ se ɔ kaseli ɔmɛ bua a he nya ekohu ngɛ tsu mi nɛ Toma hu piɛ a he. A nga sinya amɛ, se tlukaa a, Yesu ba je a kpɛti ekohu nɛ e nga mɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de Toma ke, “Mo ba slaa ye dɛ mi ɔ nɛ o ngɔ o nine nguɛ kɛ hɔ ye kasa nya a nɛ o hyɛ konɛ o ko je nɔ hu se mohu o he nɛ o ye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma he nɔ nɛ e de Yesu ke, “Ye Nutsɔ kɛ ye Mawu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Akɛnɛ o na mi ɔ he je nɛ o he ye nɛ ɔ nɛ. A maa jɔɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a nɛ mi se a he ye ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30-31" />Yesu pee nyakpɛ nihi fuu ngɛ kaseli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi se a ngmɛ ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ mi. Nɛ nyakpɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ lɛɛ a ngma konɛ nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ye kaa lɛ ji Mesia a, Mawu Bi, nɛ ke nyɛ he e nɔ ye ɔ, nyɛ ma na wami.<verse eid="JHN 20:30-31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha kaseli ɔmɛ lo ngɛ e si temi ɔ se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Pee se ɔ, Yesu je e he kpo ekohu kɛ tsɔɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ Galilea Wo ɔ nya. Nɛ bɔ nɛ e ba mi ji nɛ ɔ nɛ:<verse eid="JHN 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Kaseli nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ji, Simon Petro kɛ Toma nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ “Hawi” ɔ kɛ Natanael nɛ je Kana ngɛ Galilea kɛ Zebedeo bi ɔmɛ kɛ e kaseli kpahi enyɔ.<verse eid="JHN 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Simon Petro de mɛ ke, “I yaa wo.” Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ hu ke, “Waa kɛ mo maa ya.” Kɛkɛ nɛ a je wo. Se jamɛ a nyɔ ɔ mi kulaa a, a gbi nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Nɛ benɛ je bɔni nami ɔ, a na nɔ ko nɛ ba da si ngɛ wo ɔ nya, se a li e mi tso.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɛ mɛ nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Bimɛ, nyɛ gbe lo ko lo?” Nɛ a ha heto ke, “Dabi.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Jehanɛ ɔ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ fɔ ya a ngɛ lɛ ɔ hiɔ nɔ ma je nɛ nyɛ maa gbe lo.” A ye e gbi ɔ nɔ nɛ a fɔ ya a nɛ a gbe lo babauu bɔ nɛ a nyɛ we ya a nɛ a sa.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Kɛkɛ nɛ kaselɔ ɔ nɛ Yesu suɔ ɔ de Petro ke, “Nutsɔ ɔ i.” Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, Simon Petro wo e tade ɔ, ejakaa e hɛɛ e he gu, nɛ e tu kɛ nɔ wo ɔ mi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Se kaseli nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ tlɔ lɛ ɔ mi kɛ ba kple nɛ a ba sa ya a kɛ e mi lo ɔ kɛ ba kpo, ejakaa he nɛ a fɔ ya a ngɛ ɔ kɛ wo ɔ nya maa pee nane kami lafa etɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Benɛ a ba kple ɔ, a na kaa a slɛ la nɛ a ngɛ lo sae nɛ abolo hu ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ wo lo nɛ nyɛ gbe piɔ ɔ eko kɛ ba.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simon Petro ya sa yaa kɛ ba wo ɔ nya. Nɛ lo agbohi maa pee lafa kɛ nyingmi enuɔ kɛ etɛ sɔuu ngɛ mi, se ya a gba we.<verse eid="JHN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ba ye ni.” Nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ ko nyɛ we nɛ e bi lɛ ke lɛ ji Nutsɔ ɔ lo; ejakaa a na paa kaa lɛ i. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu wo abolo ɔ kɛ lo ɔ eko nɛ e dla kɛ ha mɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Enɛ ɔ ji si etɛ nɛ e je e he kpo kɛ tsɔɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ e si temi ɔ se.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Benɛ a ye ni ɔ ta a, Yesu bi Simon Petro ke, “Simon, Yohane bi, anɛ o suɔ mi pe ni nɛ ɔmɛ lo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Nɛ Petro he nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ee, Nutsɔ, i suɔ mo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Moo hyɛ ye to bi ɔmɛ a nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesu bi lɛ nɔ́ nɛ ji si enyɔ ke, “Simon, Yohane bi, o suɔ mi anɔkuale lo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Petro ha lɛ heto ke, “Ee, Nutsɔ, o le kaa i suɔ mo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Moo hyɛ ye to ɔmɛ a nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesu bi Petro nɔ́ nɛ ji si etɛ ke, “Simon, Yohane bi, o suɔ mi niinɛ lo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">E he wa ha Petro kaa Yesu bi lɛ munyu nɛ ɔ si etɛ sɔuu. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ e de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, o le nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ, nɛ o le kaa i suɔ mo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu de lɛ ekohu ke, “Lɛɛ moo lɛ ye to ɔmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ma de mo anɔkuale mi ke, benɛ o ngɛ nihe mi ɔ, o peeɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ o suɔ, nɛ o yaa he fɛɛ he nɛ o suɔ, se ke o bwɔ ɔ, o maa bɔle o nine mi, nɛ nɔ kpa maa tsɔɔ mo blɔ, nɛ e ma kpaka mo kɛ ya he nɛ o sume.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu de lɛ enɛ ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ gbenɔ mimi nɛ e ma gbo kɛ wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami. Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de ke, “Moo nyɛɛ ye se.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Se benɛ Petro plɛ e he ɔ, e na kaa kaselɔ ɔ nɛ Yesu suɔ ɔ nyɛɛ a se. Kaselɔ nɛ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ wo e yi ngɔ kpasa Yesu gugue mi benɛ a ngɛ ni yee ɔ, nɛ e bi lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, wa ti mɛnɔ maa tsɔɔ o se blɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Nɛ Petro bi Yesu ke, “Nutsɔ, nɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ lɛɛ nɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Nɛ Yesu ha lɛ heto ke, “Ke i suɔ kaa e hi si kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma kpale kɛ ba ekohu ɔ nɛɛ, mɛni enɛ ɔ kɔɔ ngɛ o he? Moo lɛɛ moo nyɛɛ ye se.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Kɛkɛ nɛ munyu nɛ ɔ gbɛ fia nyɛmi ɔmɛ a kpɛti ke jamɛ a kaselɔ ɔ be gboe. Se tsa pi ja a nɛ Yesu ngɛ tsɔɔe kulaa. Nɔ́ nɛ e de ɔ ji, “Ke i suɔ kaa e hi je mi kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma ba ekohu ɔ nɛɛ, jije lɔ ɔ kɔɔ ha mo lo?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Jamɛ a kaselɔ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ ye ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he odase, nɛ lɛ nɔuu ji nɔ nɛ ngma kɛ fɔ si. Nɛ wa le kaa nɔ́ nɛ e de ɔ, e ji anɔkuale.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesu pee ni kpahi fuu, nɛ e peeɔ mi kaa, ke a ke a ngma kulaa a, womi ɔmɛ maa hiɛ pe bɔ nɛ je ɔ ma nyɛ ma kɛ to.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>